<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUC-LUK-NGƆMBE-BONDJALE</book>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Luka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi Bopele bo Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Eingeli e buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta ikomi iyou ipamaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo mbala e basato adi Luka, mopalani o Polo yona odaka monganga akomaka mokanda adi Bakolosai Kol 4, 14. Mokanda mo nde modii na bikenge bibae: Mokanda mo nde mokabanani na bikenge bi bae: Bwɛndi Bopele ko na Bikɔmeli bi Bapɔsɔlu. Ainedjaka djebeli epele mɛnɛ tine botomba sɔngi, eboinedja boo isiko i Ndjakomba inɔmɔkɔ na ndjea e Yesu o Nasaleta.</para>
  <para style="is">Mondjɔ mo tina</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta moda mo bakomi mo bagɛlɛki ko na Baloma, Luka abangaka boso na ndese boso boboinedja tina e mokanda mo nde 1, 1-4. Ngɔngɔ, ta ekenge e boso 1, 5-2, 52 ebalaka tina e bobwɛngɛ bo Yoane Mobatisi ko na bo Yesu. Babwɛdji kaoko bato ibadiaka Mwembo Mosɛnɔke balotɔndeaka boo Yesu adi «Mwana o Ndjakomba», «Kilito», «Moheledja», «Kumu», modjɔ momina mobalamake na boyai ngɔngɔ. Ta ekenge e babae 3, 1-4, 13 eleho e Yoane Mobatisi edipoaka elomu e Yesu. Ebalamaka ta sinagoga e Nasaleta, elomu emina ebalamake ta ekenge e basato 4, 14-9, 50; na misala mi nde mi boheledja bato Yesu abenganaka ngulu isusu ibe ko ainedjaka epaeli e nde adi bato babe. Mbuti na nde, Yoane Mobatisi, Kumu Elode Atipasi ko na batingami ba nde babalaka tina e nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta ekenge e banɛi 9, 51-19, 28 Yesu akɛkɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Na ndjea, adaka abala na masɛ, abalaka tine bodima, moda mo batingami, bokwea ta bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Ekenge e batano 19, 29-21, 38 enɔkɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Ngɔngɔ iboimea bo ekumu, Yesu alehaka ta tepelo. Baloni ba nde banɛnɛ bahombaka bomopikea elambo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta ekenge e basamano ko na esuka 22, 1-24, 53, bosambedjama, ko boleneama bo etumbo ko bogwa ekomama elenge yogo e moto o bodjo; mokɔmeli o mabe, mobakamake mbuti na nde na baubi babae, babalakabi tine nde boo aditi moto mobe! Ngɔngɔ midjɔ mibe mi busa bo pasika bali bakɛkɛ ta ikila, bopusoa ko bopimboa bo Yesu mbuno ebosɔmbɔ bo nde tedjebamake: Bodua bo «Ngulu e diko» adi batingami. Pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ, Bwɛndi bopele bo Luka bodiaka bakilito oko na eleho. Balueli ko na bakomeli balɛdjɛkɛ midjɔ elenge: Botɔndɔ, boendja, bobotama, isɛ i «Mosamalia mopele» 10, 25-6, 37 kaoko i «Mwana mobe». 15, 11-20, 32, isaka ta Emause, elonga e Luka edi elenge ngɔmbɛ momi tina ehɔmɔkɔ tine botumba mbeka ta tepelo e Yelusalɛme, oho edaka mbangi ko suka e Bwɛndi Bopele. Bato ba ngando e Bidjatɛ babalaka boo Luka akumedjaka Malia ko mwana Yesu; embete edi bohu: bonɔ balehi bakina, Luka abalaka mɛnɛ tine bianga bi boso bi Moheledja, bohu bo «Bato bakina» ko «Ekumu e Isalɛlɛ» 2, 32. Luka akomeaka moto omɔti na kombe e Teopile yona okabosanakeso. Enakobea kombe e gɛlɛki etingodji «Mwange e Ndjakomba». Busa bu moto mosusu aboani boimea mwange e Ndjakomba! Ndjakomba, yo adi mwange bato basusu, edae Moyuda kaoko Mopangano. Nabohɔmɔ bo Malia, «Akangɔdjɔke bato bia badi pɛ tina» 1, 52. Yesu, ailonaka badieli, apalaka batakeli; ayɛkɛ mabe ma bato, nongo ekada mabe manɔke. Epaeli moda mua adi omɔti, na adi okina, edi mbea: «Kɛɛ, ko wɛ pongono kɔɔ oko moda mua» 10, 37. Sepi ebohela na Ndjakomba edi tine bato basusu.</para>
  <para style="is">Ta bokɛ bohali</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka adaka Mogɛlɛki, napɛ kitɛ adaka mongɔni o ekelesa e bayuda. Abalaka na bapangano bia bapalaka bopangoa bato ta ndjea e ikomi. Bokimana bodimana bo bato baikoaka Bibilia, buku e nde esukeamaka ta bianga tuku bomwambe bi ehole e biso, ndelo ekina boso bo biso. Malɛno ma nde madi mapele. Elenge moto mopele o hisitoale. Abalaka midjɔ na ndjea e batemo ko adjebaka midjɔ imibalamaka ehele ko mikomamaka na Malako kaoko na bato bakina. Tina e nde edaka bopingedja bodima bo Teopile, tina e mo «Mokanda momina» 1,3 modi mɛnɛ tine bato bia baikoaka Teolodji: epaeli e Ndjakomba edi mosala, mo makomi mia mambakaso, bohu bo Pasika. Luka adi mokomi yona osapaka tine boimedja bohu malɛi mia madakaso pɛ bodjeba.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Bato banɛnɛ bamekaka bokoma masolo ma midjɔ iminɔkɔ a ndanda e biso. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bakomaka meako mimina elenge ebatɔndeaka bo, na bato bia ibaenɛkɛ na miso midjɔ iminɔkɔ, donga ta mbangi, baimeaka basali ko batombaka mandi ma boleha meako mi Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Na tina emina, ta pamba e mbi, ngɔngɔ i bohomba bodjeba soti e midjɔ misusu mia iminɔkɔ ta mbangi, naenɛki bopele ta pamba e mbi, bokomea meako mimina na bodjo adi wɛ, moto o gala Teopile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Namikomi tine boo oboani bodjeba meako imi midia wɛ midi soti.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndji atɔndi bobotama bo Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />A ehole edaka Elode mokondji o ibonga i Yuda, nganga o Ndjakomba omɔti kombe e nde edaka Djakalia, adaka ta engbanga e banganga ba Ndjakomba ba iputo i Abiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokimana mosala mo gɛlɛki, Luka abalaka iya Yuda edi ngondo e bayuda.</char></note>. Mwali o nde, Elisabɛti adaka o denga i Alona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alona: nganga Ndjakomba o boso ta ehole e Bayuda.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bo basusu babae badaka bato ba bodjo ta boso bo Ndjakomba ko badaka basuma mɛnɛ mibeko ko bilomu bi Kumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Na bea baidaka na mwana, tine boo Elisabɛti adaka mwali motete ko bo basusu babae baimeaka babange.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Busa bomɔti, Djakalia adaka akɔ mosala mo nde mo bonganga bo Ndjakomba, tine boo edaka ngala e nde e bokɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Bokimana elama e banganga ba Ndjakomba, ahɔmɔkɔ na djonga tine botumba mbeka e paka malasi ta tei e polo esɛnɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 30, 7-8.</char></note> e Kumu. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ta ehole e botumba mbeka e paka malasi, iputo i bato banɛnɛ badaka bongɔnɔ sokolu.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Mbala emɔti, obwɛndji o Kumu asainedjaka na Djakalia, aemaka diko ta ebɔ e bami ta polo ekatumbebo paka malasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 30, 1-6; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">1 Bak 7, 48.</char></note> tina e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Ehole emoenɛkɛ Djakalia, alengesanaka ko alumaka na bɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Endolo obwɛndji abalaka na nde: «Djakalia pɛ boda na bɔɔ, tine boo Ndjakomba aoki miongɔnɔ mi wɛ. Mwali o wɛ Elisabɛti aoboteake mwana momi ko wa mobakeake kombe e Yoane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Mwana omina adake sepi enɛnɛ tina e wɛ ko bato banɛnɛ basepabi na bobotama bo Yoane. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Tengasa adabi mosali monɛnɛ ta boso bo Kumu. Amwɛtebi vino kaoko mana mapipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mit 6, 3.</char></note>, tine boo alumabi na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke donga ta sɔpɔ i nange e nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Asɔmbedjabi bato banɛnɛ ba Isalɛlɛ ta pamba e Kumu Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mlk 2, 6.</char></note> o bobo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Adalabi ta boso bo Kumu, na mwembo ko na kpatsi e mbaeli o Ndjakomba Elia, tine bosɔmbedja milema mi ba tata ta pamba e bɛngɛ, ko bato ba itio ta ndjea e bowɛi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mlk 3, 23-24.</char></note>, abɔngedjabi bato tina e Kumu.» <verse eid="LUK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Na bea Djakalia abalaka na obwɛndji: «Nadjebake meako mimina midi soti moda nda? Tine boo mbi naimei mobange, ko mwali o mbi aimei ko mobange.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Obwɛndji amosɔmbedjaka: «Mbi nadi Gabiyɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dan 8, 16; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">9, 21; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Luk 1, 26.</char></note>, nakaemae ta boso bo Ndjakomba. Nalomami tine botɔndea wɛ bwɛndi bopele. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Na bea elenge okiti mibalo mi mbi, mikokedjamabi ta ehole ebɔngedjama; waimeake emimi ko odaetebi na enɔeli e bobala mbunoko isu imeake modjɔ momina.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ta ehole emina, bato badaka bamba Djakalia ko bakamoaka moda moyeyoaka yo ta tepelo esɛnɔke. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ehole eimaka yo, aidaka naikina na enɔeli e bobala na bu ko bato badjebaka boo aeni ndjɛnɛ ta tepelo esɛnɔke. Tengasa aimeaka bobala na bu na bimbete ko adikaka emimi. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ehole esidjaka Djakalia ngala e nde bokɔ mosala mo bonganga bo Ndjakomba, asɔmbɔkɔ ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ngɔngɔ i moehole, mwali o nde Elisabɛti alwaka demi ko asabombaka songe batano. Asabaleaka: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Endja eka ekɔi Kumu na mbi: adimi botingoani edɛdi ta modjɔ mokɔkini sɔni ta miso ma bato.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndji atɔndi gala e bobotama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ngɔngɔ i songe basamano, Ndjakomba alomaka obwɛndji Gabiyɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 19 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note> ta ibonga imɔti i Galilea, ekabeame Nasaleta. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Amolomaka adi moseka mwali odaa pɛ boda na bami ohɔmɔkɔ na moki, na momi omɔti, kombe e nde Esepu. Yo adaka ta pako e kumu Dapiti. Kombe e moseka mwali edaka Malia. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Obwɛndji akweaka adi Malia ko abalaka na nde: «Osisoi! Ndjakomba akɔi na wɛ mongandi, ko adi engbanga na wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Malia ayegebanaka na kɔpi emina; asahɔdjɔkɔ eka etingodjaka ndese emina. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Endolo Obwɛndji abalaka na nde: «Pɛ bobanga Malia, tengasa odihi mongandi ta boso bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Endja walwoake demi ko wabotake mwana momi, omopabi kombe e Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Adabi moto monɛnɛ ko bamobeabi Mwana o Ndjakomba yona odi odiko i losusu. Kumu Ndjakomba amodedjabi ta ngbɛndɛ e kɔkɔ e nde Dapiti. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Adabi Kumu ta denga i Djakobo, ko bokumu bo nde bodaetebi na suka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 Sa 7, 12, 13, 16; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ese 9, 6; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Dan 7, 14.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Malia abali na obwɛndji: «Modjɔ momina modabi moda nda? Tengasa napakini aputoana na momi.» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Obwɛndji amosɔmbedjaka: «Mwembo Mosɛnɔke aduabi ta diko i wɛ ko ngulu e Ndjakomba yona odi odiko i losusu aodipabi na esii e nde. Ko yo yona obotamabi na wɛ adabi mosɛnɔke, abeamabi Mwana o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Elisabɛti, mwange e wɛ mwali, alwai demi i mwana momi ta bobange bo nde, idi edɛdi na songe basamano, yona odaka bo babea mwali motete. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Tengasa pɛ modjɔ monɔi Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mba18, 14.</char></note> na bopipo.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Na bea Malia amosɔmbedjaka: «Nadi mobuli o Kumu. Kina boo misusu mikɔme na mbi oko moda mobali wɛ.» Ko obwɛndji amokinaka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malia akɛi aendja Elisabɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ngɔngɔ i baasu, Malia akɛkɛ pɛpɛlɛ ta ibonga imɔti i ikoli i Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Akweaka ta ndako e Djakalia ko aiseaka Elisabɛti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Oko ta ehole eokaka Elisabɛti ndese e Malia, mwana akumanaka ta sɔpɔ i Elisabɛti. Ibea alumaka na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />ko agamaka na ngulu: «Ndjakomba aodjongoi bonɔ bali basusu, mwana odi ta sɔpɔ i wɛ, adjongoami na Ndjakomba! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Mbi nadi nda? Tine boo nange e Kumu adue adi mbi? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Tengasa, oko ta ehole eiseini wɛ, mwana akumani na sepi enɛnɛ ta sɔpɔ i mbi. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Odi Mwali osepi! Wɛ iyo opala meako i mi mibalaka Kumu Ndjakomba na wɛ, mikokedjamabi!»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yembo e Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Ibea Malia abalaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 46-55 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ko ta 1Sa 2, 1-10.</char></note>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Kina boo molema mo mbi mosusu mokumedje Kumu!<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Nalumi na sepi enɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:47">tina e Ndjakomba, Moheledji o mbi.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Tengasa aendjini na miso ma nde ma epaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">mbi mobuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1Sa 1, 11.</char></note> o nde otaka ekumu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Soti, donga edɛdi mbunoko bihole bisusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">bato basusu babeabini mwali o mongandi!<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Tengasa, Ndjakomba yona odi odiko i losusu akɔi na mbi midjɔ mi bokamoa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Kombe e nde edi Esɛnɔke!<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ko bopele bo nde bokayeyoe bihole bisusu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:50">adi bia bakamosume!<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Akɔi meako mi bokamoa na ngulu e ebɔ e nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">ananganedji bato ba mopopo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Ahombedja bato ba ngulu ta ngbɛndɛ i bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">endolo angɔdji bato ngasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yob 5, 11; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">12, 19.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Akapɛ mia adi bato ba ndja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">ko akayanedje badieli mɔmɔ ngasa.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Soti adoi akamoa Isalɛlɛ, mosali o nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">ko abositi boinedja bopele bo nde;<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />moda mobala yo na ba kɔkɔ ba biso, adi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">Abalayama ko na bwela bo nde tine kɔbili na kɔbili.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Malia adaka adi Elisabɛti mbuti na songe basato, ngɔngɔ ayanaka ta ndako e nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisabɛti aboti Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ehole e masu ma bobota bo Elisabɛti makokaka, abotaka mwana momi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bato badaka mbuti na nde ko denga i nde baoka bo Kumu amokɔi mongandi monɛnɛ ko basepaka na nde engbanga emɔti.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1, 59 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 12, 3.</char>
    </note> Ta isu i bomwambe, bakɛkɛ na mwana tine bomolena epole. Bapalaka bomopa kombe e Sange e nde Djakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Endolo nange e nde alonaka ko abalaka: «Ngasa, kombe e nde Yoane.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bamotondeaka: «Ngasa, pɛ moto omɔti o denga i wɛ odi na kombe emina!» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Na bea basolaka na sange e mwana na bimbete, ebɛngi badjebe kombe apalaka yo babee mwana. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Djakalia ahɔdjɔkɔ moo ibaya mokɛkɛ ko akomaka ena mibalo imi: «Kombe e nde Yoane.» Bato basusu bakamoaka. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Mbala emɔti Djakalia asɔmbɔkɔ naikina bobala ko akumedja Ndjakomba na kɔpi epipo. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Ibea, bato basusu badaka mbuti balumaka na bɔɔ; ko ibonga i makoli masusu ma Yudea badaka batomba sɔngi e meako mimina. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bato basusu ibaokaka modjɔ momina, badaka balɛdjɛ eni basahɔdjɔ: «Mwana omina adake ngɔngɔ nda?» Ngulu e Kumu edi na nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yembo e Djakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Djakalia, sange e mwana, alumaka na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko abalaka mibalo i mi:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Kumu, Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ, akumedjame;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">tengasa adoi akɔmedja bato ba nde ko bobaimedja basɔmi!<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Alopi tina e biso Moheledja o ngulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">ta tei e denga i Dapiti, mosali o nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Amikokedji oko elenge amaka yo bala ehele na ndjea e basɛnɔke ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Alolomea Moheledji alotingoe ta mɔmɔ ma bato babe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">ko na bokumu adi baloni ba biso.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ainedji bopele bo nde adi ba kɔkɔ ba biso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">Ko aibosa bwela bo nde bosɛnɔke.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Akokedja bhɛli e bhɛlɛ yo na Abalayama, kɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 73 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mba 22, 16-17.</char></note> e biso boo<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Alodongedjabi ta mɔmɔ ma baloni ba biso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">tine lomokɔme napɛ bɔɔ,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />na bosɛnɔ ko na bodjo ta boso bo nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:75">masu masusu ma mohelo mo biso.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ko wɛ, mwa mba, odabi mbaeli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">o Ndjakomba yona odi odiko i losusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">tengasa odalabi boso bo Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">tine bobɔngedja ndjea e nde,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />botɔndea bato ba nde boo abaheledjabi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">ko ayɛbi mabe ma bobo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Edi oko bea, tengasa Ndjakomba o biso aluma na bopele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">na tine emina, alopabi bohu, bokadonge o diko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">elenge akaime modakabusa ehuma.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Aimabi tine boinedja bohu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">adi bato badi ta bulu ko ta modidi mo bogwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ko bodaledja mako ma biso ta ndjea e bomwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 79 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mba 9, 1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana akandoaka ko Mwembo mo nde moimeaka na ngulu. Adaka ta polo i bitengelenge mbunoko ta isu isinedja yo ta miso ma bato ba Isalɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bobotama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1, 18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ta ehole emina, kumu monɛnɛ o Loma Sedjale Ogusitɛ, apaka mobeko boo bato basusu bakɛ bokomedja kombe tine bodjeba motango mo bato basusu badaka ta ngondo ekondjaka yo ta Loma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Edaka mbala e boso e bokomedja kombe ehole edaka Kilinusu gupɛnɛlɛ ta ngondo e Sulia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bato basusu bakɛkɛ bokomedja kombe, moto na moto na ibonga i nde mɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Esepu akinaka Nasaleta ta ekenge e ibonga i Galilea. Akɛkɛ ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ta ekenge e ibonga i Yudea, tengasa adaka moto o denga i ibonga ibotamaka Dapiti.<verse eid="LUK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Akɛkɛ bokomedja kombe e nde engbanga emɔti na Malia, mwali o nde ohɔmɔkɔ na moki ko yona odaka na demi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Enakobea ehole edaka bo ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, masu ma bobota bo nde makokaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ibea Malia abotaka mwana momi o boso o nde, amohuaka na bisendja ko amosambeaka ta eyedji e bhata, tengasa polo eidaka tine bobo ta ndako ekasɔe bo bakɛndɛli.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwɛndji asinedji na babanei ba bhata</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 2:1-15">Mat 2, 1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ta ibonga imina, babanei ba bhata badaka ta gbie tine e bobanea bhata na bulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Obwɛndji o Kumu asainedjaka ta boso bo bobo, ibea bohu bo ekumu e kumu ebadipaka ko baimeaka na bɔɔ mɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Na bea obwɛndji abalaka na bu: «Pɛ bobangani, tengasa nadoi aotɔndeani Bwɛndi bo mɔti bopele, ibu bosepedjabi bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Na bulu bo busa bu, baoboteini Moheledji ta ibonga i Dapiti, yo adi Kilito, Kumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ko endja embete e bokamoa iye eopini mbi: wataneakeni mwana mopu oboti bo, ahuami na bisendja ko asambi ta eyedji e bhata.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Na mbala emɔti, obwɛndji ko na bakina banɛnɛ baduaka aputoana na nde ko babangaka bokumedja Ndjakomba. Babalaka:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Ekumu adi Ndjakomba iyona odi diko i losusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">ko bogo ta kpɔtɔ adi bato bakamopale!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ehole eyanaka babwɛndji o diko, babanei ba bhata basabaleanaka: «Lokɛni ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ tine bodjeba meako imi misimea, milotɔndei Kumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bakɛkɛ pɛpɛlɛ ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ ko bataneaka Malia, Esepu na mwana mopu, asambi ta eyedji e bhata. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ehole enɛ bo mwana, babalaka meako misusu mibatɔndeaka obwɛndji ta tina e mwana omina. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bato basusu ibaokaka meako mimina ta minɔko mi babanei ba bhata, bakamoaka mɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Malia abaneaka meako mia ta molema ko bohomba bodjeba tina e meako mimina. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ngɔngɔ, babanei ba bhata bayanaka. Badaka bokumedja Ndjakomba ko boemba ndjembo, tine meako misusu miokaka bo na mienɛkɛ bo, tengasa mibwanaka na mia mibatɔndeaka obwɛndji.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakɛi na Yesu ta Tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ngɔngɔ i masu bomwambe, ehole ebolena mwana epole eimeaka; ibea bamobakeaka kombe e Yesu, oko moda motɔndeaka obwɛndji Malia boso bo alwae demi. <verse eid="LUK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ko yana aimeaka ehole e bosasɛnodja, bobwana na mobeko mo Mose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 12, 3,6 Mose adaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba</char></note>, Esepu na Malia bakɛkɛ na mwana ta Yelusalɛmɛ tine bomoinedja Kumu; <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />tengasa boboana na moda mokomama ta mobeko mo Kumu: «Mwana mosusu momi o boso yona oboti bo aboani bomobondjea adi Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 13, 2,12.</char></note> elenge ikabo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Eso 13, 2,11-13 Eka epi bo</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Boboana na mobeko mo Kumu, bapaka adi Ndjakomba mbeka edowa mwali na momi kaoko bana ba bimbenga babae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta lew 12, 8</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Moto omɔti adaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ kombe e nde Simeona. Moto omina adaka bodjo na isuma, adaka amba isu igɔledjamabi Isalɛlɛ, ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke modaka na nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mo motɔndeaka boso boo agwɛtebi mbunoko akaenɛ Kilito, Kumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mo molomaka, ta tepelo, oko ta ehole emina, baboti ba Yesu bakɛkɛ na nde tine bokokedja meako imihɔdjɔkɔ mobeko. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeona amotombaka ta mɔmɔ ma nde ko akumedjaka Ndjakomba. Abalaka:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Edɛdi, Kumu, okokedji mbuno e wɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">kina mosali o wɛ aheme na bogo. <verse eid="LUK 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Tengasa miso ma mbi maeni Moheledji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 40, 5</char></note>,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />yona obɔngedja wɛ tina e bato basusu:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Yo adi moi mo bohu adiko i bato</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">badi pɛ boda Isalɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">ko gala adi bato ba nde, Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 42, 6; 49, 6; 52, 10</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Sange e nde na nange e nde badaka bokamoa meako midaka Simeona abala ta tina e nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeona abadjongoaka ko abalaka na Malia nange e Yesu: «Mwana iyo alomama bo adae ibaku tina e botitedja kaoko boangɔdjɔ bato banɛnɛ ba Isalɛlɛ. Adabi embete ekitɛ ebogbɔtodja bato; <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />na bea aimedjabi ta bohu malɛi imabolama ta milema mi bato; ko wɛ, nange e nde, ookabi saya ta molema elenge bakoindea ikɔngɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana, mbaeli o Ndjakomba mwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Edaka na mbaeli o Ndjakomba mwali omɔti kombe e nde Ana, mwana mwali o Panuwele, o pako e Aselo. Aimeaka mobange mɛnɛ. Ayeyoaka ta moki mbula sambo na muma nde omoasɔkɔ donga ta bobwɛngɛ bo nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Adikaka mwali o bogwa mbunoko akokedjaka mbula tuku bo mwambe na banei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adikaka mwali o bogwa mbula tuku bomwambe na ba banei </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">adikamaka mwali o bogwa bianga </char><char style="fp" closed="false">tuku bomwambe na bi mei.</char></note>. Adaka ta tepelo bihole bisusu, bokɔmea Ndjakomba bulu na moi, ko na bokia mia ko bongɔnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Aimeaka ehole emina, apaka Ndjakomba mɛlɛsi na botɔndɔ meako tina e mwana adi bato basusu bia bambaka mohelo mo Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ehole esidjaka baboti ba Yesu meako misusu boboana na moda molomaka mobeko mo Kumu, bayanaka ta Nasaleta ibonga i bobo mɛnɛ yena edaka ta Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana akandoaka, asapingedjaka, alumaka na mongandi ko na epaeli e Ndjakomba edaka diko i nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta Tepelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Baboti ba nde bakɛkɛ mbula na mbula ta Yelusalɛmɛ, tine tɛkɛ e Pasika. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ehole ekokedjaka Yesu mbula domi na babae, bakɛkɛ ta tɛkɛ elenge edaka bokɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 12, 1-27; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Det 16, 1-8. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edaka mbuti na mbula ba bomoto bo edimeli ta yuda.</char></note> bo bobo. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ehole esiaka masu ma tɛkɛ, bahulaka, mwana Yesu adikaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ endolo baboti ba nde baidjebaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Balɛdjɛkɛ adaka adale engbanga emɔti na bange i nde ba mɔndɔ ko bakɔ busa itombo. Ngɔngɔ bamohombaka ta tei e denga ikina ko na badjebani ba nde; <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />endolo baimodiaka. Ko basɔmbɔkɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ a mohomba. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ngɔngɔ i masu masato, bamotaneaka ta Tepelo, adi na mobondo a ndanda e balehi ba mobeko, abahokamedja ko abahɔdjɔkɔ mahɔdjɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bato ibadaka bamohokamedja, badaka bakamoa na bowɛi bo nde ko na misɔmbedja mi nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ehole emoenɛ baboti ba nde bakamoaka; nange e nde abalaka na nde: «Mwamba, olokɔi boo tina nda? Sange e wɛ ko na mbi, lohombaka na bɔɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Tina ndani wahombakanini? Otadjebakani boo natungi nadae ta ndako e sange e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Natungi nadae ta ndako e sange e mbi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ta makomi makina na tungi bosapa na midjɔ mi sange mbi. </char></note>?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Endolo bo baidjebaka tina e kɔpi emina ebabalea yo. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu ayanaka na bu engbanga emɔti ta Nasaleta, adaka abasuma ko nange e nde abaneaka meako mimina misusu ta molema. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Ko Yesu akandoaka, na djebeli ko adaka asepedja Ndjakomba ko na bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta 1Sam 2, 26; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mas 3, 4.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ilako i Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ehole e Tibele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adaka motitani o Agusite ta kiti e bokumu; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">adaka kumu monɛnɛ boso bo Yesu.</char></note> mokondji monɛnɛ, akokedjaka bianga domi na itano ta kpatsi, Pɔsɔ Pilato adaka gupɛnɛlɛ o Yudea; Elode, gupɛnɛlɛ o Galilea, Pilipo mwange e nde, gupɛnɛlɛ o mokpɔtɔ mo Ituli na Talakonia, ko Lisania gupɛnɛlɛ o Abilɛnɛ; <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ana na Kaipa badaka bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba. Ndjakomba aloma mibalo mi nde na ndjea e Yoane, mwana o Djakalia ta etengelenge. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yoane akɛkɛ ta mabonga masusu i mbuti mbuti e duwa e Yolodane. Alehaka «Hombedjani milema mi bino, inamani ko Ndjakomba ayɛke mabe ma bino.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Bokokana na moda mokoma bo ta buku e mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">«Edi yona adumbeaka ta etengelenge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">bɔngedjani ndjea e Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">ninodjani ndjea tina e Nde!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Mimbɔndɔ misusu milumedjame na kpɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">gangala na makoli masusu malambasane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">ndjea i magbukundɔngu isusu djime bodjo.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Ko bato basusu baenɛbi mohelo mo Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Es 40, 3-5, </char><char style="fp" closed="false">elangama ta makomi mayou na gɛlɛki.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Abalaka pongono na emumu e bato ibaduaka tine bodia inelo. «Ibota i ndjɔ! Oinedjini ndjea e botia kɛlɛ aduake nda? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Botani mbuma i pele djinedjaka boo ohombedjeni milema mi bino! Ko pɛ bobalani tina e bino bɛnɛ boo: “Lodi na Abalayama sange biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yoa 8, 33,37,39.</char></note>.” Tengasa naotɔndeini boo Ndjakomba aboani bohombedja mabanga mi, bana ba Abalayama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Edɛdi mɛnɛ soka edi mbuti tine bolenakaka mele mbunoko ta nginga: mole mosusu modi pɛ bobota mbuma i pele makwɛlɛmɛke ko bomodumba ta mosa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Emumu e bato bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Eboani so bɔkɔ nde?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Moto odi na bisendja bibae, apɛ emɔti adi yona watakaka ko yona odi na moeka oboyaka akɔe oko moda momina.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Baputedji ba puti pongono baduaka tine boinama ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Molehi, lokɔe bo?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Pɛ bohɔdjɔni eka bonɔ moda mopini bo motuya mo puti.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Basoda pongono bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Ko iso, lokɔe bo?» Abalaka na bu: «Pɛ bokatoani palanga i moto na ngulu, pɛ bokoseani moto ikambo; endolo sepani na iputi i bino.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bato basusu badaka bamba na ndingo enɛnɛ ko moto na moto adaka asahɔdjɔ, kaoko Yoane aidaka Kilito. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yoane asɔmbedjaka bato basusu: «Mbi, noinakani na madiba, endolo edi na moto omɔti aduake anɔini na ngulu ko mbi na boaniti bosunama tine bolodja ngɔli i sapato i nde edi yo moto wobatisakeni na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko na mosa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Adi na ikanya ta ebɔ e nde tine bohɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ikanya i bohɔ mbuma </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 3, 12 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ko ta molɔngɔ mokina.</char></note> mbuma i bule na poso, endolo poso imina itumbamabi ta mosa mokadae pɛ bodimea.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yoane alehaka Bwɛndi Bopele adi bato banɛnɛ pongono tine bobapingedja. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Endolo Elode gupɛnɛlɛ o mokpɔtɔ mo Galilea, yona odosamaka na Yoane tine asɔkɔ Elodiade, mwali o mwange e nde, ko akɔkɔ pongono meako minɛnɛ mibe. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Elode akɔkɔ naikina modjɔ mobe bonɔ: apedjaka Yoane ko amoisaka ta bɔlɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boinama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ehole einamaka bato basusu, Yesu pongono ainamaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngɔngɔ i bobatisama </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ta makomi makina ngondo ebatisama na nde.</char></note>. Ko ta ehole edaka yo aongɔnɔ, busa bodipoamaka <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke motitaka ta diko i nde elenge embenga. Ko kɔpi eokamaka ta busa bobala: «Wɛ odi Mwana o mbi oepaeli, na sepi na wɛ mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 2, 7; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Es 42, 1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakɔkɔ ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu adaka na mbula mbuti na tuku isato ehole ebangaka yo elomu e nde. Bato balɛdjɛkɛ boo yo adi mwana o Esepu. Esepu adaka mwana o Elia, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />mwana o Matatiasi, mwana o Lewi, mwana o Mɛlɛki, mwana o Yoanani, mwana o Esepu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwana o Matatasi, mwana o Amosa, mwana o Nauma, mwana o Esile, Esile adaka mwana o Nagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />mwana o Mata, mwana o Matatiasi, mwana o Semeni, mwana o Djosɛkɛ, mwana o Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />mwana o Yaonasi, mwana o Ledja, mwana o Djolobabɛlɛ, Mwana o Salatiela, mwana o Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwana o Mɛlɛki, mwana o Adi, mwana o Kosama, mwana o Elimadama, mwana o Elɛ, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />mwana o Yesu, mwana o Eliedjɛlɛ, mwana o Yolima, mwana o Matati, mwana o Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />mwana o Simeona, mwana o Yuda, mwana o Esepu, mwana o Yoanama, mwana o Eliakime, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />mwana o Meleya, mwana o Mena, mwana o Matata, mwana o Nata, Nata adaka mwana o Dapiti, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />mwana o Yese, mwana o Obɛdɛ, mwana o Boadji, mwana o Sala, mwana o Nasɔni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />mwana o Aminadabe, Mwana o Adalani, mwana o Alini. Alini adaka mwana o Esɛlɔne. Esɛlɔne adaka mwana o Pɛlɛsɛ. Pɛlɛse mwana o Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />mwana o Djakobo, Djakobo mwana o Isaka, Isaka mwana o Abalayama, Abalayama mwana o Tela, Tela mwana o Nakoli, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />mwana o Seluke. Seluge mwana o Lew. Lew mwana o Pɛlɛge. Pɛlɛge mwana o Ebɛlɛ. Ebɛlɛ mwana o Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwana o Kenani. Kenani mwana o Alapadjadi. Alapadjadi mwana o Sɛmɛ. Sɛmɛ mwana o Nowa. Nowa mwana o Lemɛki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mwana o Matusalɛmɛ. Matusalɛmɛ mwana o Enɔkɛ. Enɔkɛ mwana o Yɛlɛdi. Yɛlɛdi mwana o Malalɛlɛ. Malalɛlɛ mwana o Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />mwana o Enosi, mwana o Sɛti, mwana o Adama, Adama adaka mwana o Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu amekami na Satana</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu, alumaka na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, asɔmbɔkɔ ta duwa e Yolodane, ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke mo molomaka ta etengelenge, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />oho amekamaka na satana masu tuku inɛi. Aiyaka eka emɔti masu mamina masusu ko, ngɔngɔ i masu mamina bokoka, aokaka ndja. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Na bea Satana abalaka na nde: «Okada Mwana o Ndjakomba, bala na ibanga di ihombane mwɛmbɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Ekomama: “Moto aboaniti bohela oto na mwɛmbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dut 8, 3</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Djabulu akɛi na nde odiko, amoinedjaka na mbala emɔti makondji masusu ma bokumu bo ngondo <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />ko abalaka na nde: «Nopakedea kpatsi ko na ekumu e makumu mi; tengasa losusu lopami na mbi, ko naboani bopa adi moto opali mbi. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ekadabo okwi magbundɔ ta boso bo mbi, losusu ladake lo wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Ekomama: “Kumedja Kumu, Ndjakomba o wɛ, ko mokumedja oko yo pɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Satana akɛkɛ na nde naikina ta Yelusalɛmɛ, amoiwedjaka ta sɔngɔ e tepelo, ko abalaka na nde: «Ekadabo odi Mwana o Ndjakomba, sadumba ta kpɔtɔ; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />tengasa ekomama: “Ndjakomba alomake babwɛndji ba nde tine bobanea.” <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />“Ko baokake ta mɔmɔ ma bobo tine boo eko e wɛ esakata ibanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 91, 1-12</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Ekomama: “Oboaniti bomeka Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dut 6, 16</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ngɔngɔ i bosidja bomomeka, djabulu asasuaka na nde mo ehole.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbangi e mosala mo Yesu ta Galilea</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ ta Galilea, molumake na ngulu e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. Gala e nde enanganaka ta ibonga isusu. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Alehaka ta sinagoga ko bato basusu bamokumedjaka.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baloni Yesu ta Nasaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu ahulaka ta Nasaleta, oho ta ibonga ikandoa yo. Ko akweaka ta sinagoga, bokokana na moda mo nde, ta busa bo sabata. Angɔ tine bolanga mokanda, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />ko bamopaka buku e mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya. Adipoaka buku ko ataneaka molɔngɔ mo ekenge ye ekomama:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Mwembo mo Kumu modi diko i mbi, tine boo asuoni munɛ tine boleha Bwɛndi Bopele adi batakeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Alomani tine botɔndea bato bapeama, badihi bosɔmi, ko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">bato bagwa miso basɔmbe boenɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">boboanedja bato ibanɔngɔkɔ badie bosɔmi;<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Bodumbea boo mbula yo Ndjakomba ainedjabi bopele bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 61, 1-2.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu adipaka buku, aepaka adi mosali ko ada na mobondo. Miso ma bato basusu, ta sinagoga, madaka manoedja. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Na bea abalaka na bu: «Busa bu ikomi di isokano, ikokedjami.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bato basusu ibadaka ena babalaka tati i bosakoa ta tina e nde, badaka bakamoa na kɔpi i bosakoa imaka ta monɔkɔ mo nde. Babalaka: «Iyo te mwana o Esepu?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Abalaka na bu: «Soti mɛnɛ wabalakeni isɛ idi: “Monganga, saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ”. Wabaleakenini pongono: “Misusu minɔkɔ ta Kapalanauma, na misusu mioka so mikɔɔ pongono iya ta ibonga i wɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na bu naikina: «Okobea, pɛ nongo mbaeli o Ndjakomba omɔti odimama ta ibonga i nde. Notɔndeini soti boo tebadime mbaeli o Ndjakomba ta ibonga i nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ta soti edaka na bali bagwa na bami banɛnɛ ta Isalɛlɛ ta ehole e Elia, ehole edipamaka busa bianga bisato ko na songe ba samano ko ndja edaka enɛnɛ ta ngondo esusu. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ko ta ehole emina Elia ailomama adi omɔti o bali, endolo adi mwali ogwa na momi ta ibonga i Salepeta ta ngondo e Sidona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1 Bak 17, 8-16</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Edaka yana pongono bato banɛnɛ ba mabha ta Isalɛlɛ ta ehole e mbaeli o Ndjakomba Elisa; ko ta ehole emina pɛ omɔti o bobo osɛnoaka, endolo oko Namana, mo Sulia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 Bak 5, 1-14.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ehole eokaka bo bea, bato basusu ta Sinagoga balumaka na kɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bangɔkɔ, babenganaka Yesu sokolu e ibonga inɛnɛ ko bakɛkɛ na nde ta sɔngɔ e ikoli ta polo edongaka bo ibonga inɛnɛ i Nasaleta, bɛngi bamohilingodje nase. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Endolo Yesu, anɔkɔ ta ndanda e bobo ko akɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto oyekama na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk 1, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu akɛkɛ ta Kapalanauma, ibonga inɛnɛ i Galilea, alehaka ta busa bo sabata. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Bato bakamoaka na eleho e nde, tengasa mobalo mo nde modaka na kpatsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Edaka ta sinagoga momi omɔti oyekamaka na mwembo mobe. Ko alɛbɛkɛ: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«A!, Opali na su bo Yesu o Nasaleta? Odoi tine bolobedja? Nodjebi bopele moda modi wɛ: Mosɛnɔke olomami na Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu amogameaka ko abalaka na nde: «Pɔpɔnɔ ko ima adi momi iyo!» Mwembo mobe modumbaka momi ta kpɔtɔ ta boso bo bato basusu ko moimaka ko pɛ bomokɔ bobe bomɔti. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bato basusu baimeaka na bokamoa ko basabaleanaka: «Iye kɔpi nda? Abalaka na kpatsi ko na ngulu adi miembo mibe ko mimaka!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ko gala e Yesu enanganaka ta mokpɔtɔ mosusu mo ngondo emina.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato banɛnɛ ba bego.</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk 1, 29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu aimaka ta sinagoga ko akɛkɛ ta ndako e Simo. Bokio bo Simo o mwali adaka na pɛpɛlɛ epipo ko bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu amoheledje. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu asunamaka mbuti na nde, agameaka pɛpɛlɛ. Pɛpɛlɛ esiaka, na mbala emɔti angɔkɔ ko abangaka bobakɔmedja.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Mɔkɔmɔkɔ, bato basusu ibadaka na bipeko mindumba na mindumba baduaka na bu adi Yesu. Abaheledjaka na bobabakea mɔmɔ adi omɔti na omɔti o bobo. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Miembo mibe minɛnɛ mimaka pongono adi bato ba bipeko na bolɛbɛ: «Wɛ odi Mwana o Ndjakomba!» Endolo Yesu amigameaka ko aimipaka enɔi e bobala, tengasa badjebaka boo adi Kilito.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alaki ta sinagoga</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk 1, 35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Aya busa, Yesu aimaka ko akɛkɛ ta etengelenge. Emumu enɛnɛ e bato bamohombaka ko bakɛkɛ mbunoko adi yo, ko bamosiaka adae pɛ bobakina. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Endolo abalaka na bu: «Etungi na mbi boleha Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba ta mabonga makina manɛnɛ pongono, tengasa edi tina elomama na mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ko Yesu alehaka bwɛndi Bopele ta ba sinagoga i Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahɔ batingami ba boso</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4, 18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1, 16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Elenge emumu enɛnɛ e bato basalindaka mbuti na nde tine boka mobalo mo Ndjakomba, ko aemaka mbuti na ibongu i ibeke i Genesaleta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Moda mokina mo bobea ibeke li Galilea Endja pongono ta Mlk 6, 53</char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yesu aenɛkɛ mato mabae matingi ta ibongu. Baoweli ba swi batitaka ta madiba tine bososa midjanga mi bobo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu atiteaka ta bwato bo Simo. Amohɔdjɔkɔ amolinde ta mo mbɛngɛ, ibea adaka na mobondo ta bwato ko abangaka boleha emumu e bato.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ehole esidjaka yo boleha, abalaka na Simo: «Linda bwato ta mbɛngɛ, ko dumbani midjanga mi bino tine bowa swi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simo amosɔmbedjaka: «Molehi, losali bulu bosusu lodihiti eka. Endolo tine mobalo mo wɛ, na dumbaka midjanga.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ehole edumbaka bo midjanga bataedjaka swi banɛnɛ ko midjanga mi bobo mibangaka boaleana. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bapupeaka mɔmɔ adi babinabu idaka ta bwato bokina bɛngi badue abakamoa. Babinabu baduaka ko, balumedjaka mato masusu mabae, mbunoko mahombaka madinde. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ehole enɛkɛ Simo Piɛlɛ bea, akwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo Yesu ko abalaka: «Kumu, donga mbuti na mbi, tengasa nadi moto mobe!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Tengasa badaka na bɔɔ, yo na binande, tine swi banɛnɛ baowaka bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Edaka ko bea tine Djake ko na Yoane, bana ba Djebede, bia badaka badale engbanga emɔti na Simo. Endolo Yesu abalaka na Simo: «Pɛ bobanga; donga edɛdi edi ndolo bato bahombake wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Na bea basɛmedjaka mato ongondo bakinaka losusu ko bamokimana.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1, 40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Na bea busa bo mɔti Yesu adaka ta ibonga imɔti, momi omɔti o mabha aduaka adi yo. Ehole enɛkɛ yo Yesu, asuneaka boso ta kpɔtɔ ko amongɔnɔkɔ: «Kumu, okapala, oboani bosɛnodjani.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu aninodjaka ebɔ e nde, amobɛndjɛkɛ ko abalaka: «Napali, sɛnoa!» Na mbala emɔti, mabha masiaka. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na nde: «Adae pɛ botɔndea moto. Endolo abala kɛɛ asinedje adi Nganga o Ndjakomba, ko ta tina ebosɛnoa bo wɛ, pa ikabo elenge ekoma Mose, tine boinedja adi bato basusu boo osɛnɔi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 14, 2-32.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Babalaka tina e Yesu bobuke mɛnɛ; bimumu binɛnɛ bi bato biputoana tine bomoka ko tine bahele na bipeko bi bobo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Endolo bihole binɛnɛ Yesu asasuaka bohali ta bitengelenge tine bongɔnɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji etumbe ondɔ mako</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Busa bo mɔti, yana adaka Yesu alehaka. Bapalusai na balehi ba mobeko badaka ena; badongaka ta ngando isusu i Galilea ko i Yudea, ko na i Yelusalɛmɛ. Ko ngulu e Ndjakomba edaka adi Yesu tine boheledja bato ba bego. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Bato bamɔti baimeaka basongaka, na bokaki, etumbɛ ondɔ mako; badaka bahomba ndjea ebomokwedja ta ndako bɛngi bamosambe ta boso bo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Elenge adakabo pɛ bodia ndjea e bomokwedja ta tei e ndako, tine emumu e bato, baiweaka ta diko i ndonga e ndako, badongedjaka ekenge e ndɛlɛ ta ndonga e ndako, bamotitedjaka na bokaki, ta ndanda e bato, ta boso bo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu bodima bo bobo, abalaka: «Maninga, mabe ma wɛ mayɛmi.»<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Balehi ba mobeko na bapalusai basahɔdjɔkɔ: «Moto iyo adi mɛnɛ nda? Ataka Ndjakomba! Moto oboani boyɛ mabe nda? Emitida Ndjakomba yo mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Endolo elenge Yesu adjebaka malɛi ma bobo, abasɔmbedjaka: «Tina nda milema mi bino midi bolɛdjɛ bea? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Modjɔ monɔi na bopɛtɛ nda? Bobala na moto: “Mabe ma wɛ mayɛmi” kaoko bobala: “Angɔ ko dala?” <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Endolo, wadjebakeni boo Mwana o Moto adi na kpatsi iya ta kpɔtɔ tine boyɛ mabe ma bato.» Ibea abalaka na etumbɛ ondɔ mako: «Angɔ, tomba bokaki bo wɛ ko yana ta ndako e wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Gbundumo, etumbɛ omina angɔkɔ ta boso bo bato, atombaka bokaki bo nde ko ayanaka eni akumedje Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Bato basusu bakamoaka, bakumedjaka Ndjakomba; balumaka na bɔɔ ko babalaka: «Busa bu mɛnɛ, iso loeni midjɔ mi bokamoa!»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abea Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk 2, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ngɔngimina, Yesu aimaka ko aenɛkɛ moputedji o puti kombe e nde Lewi, adaka adi ta bilo e nde e mosala.Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kimanani!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi akinaka losusu, angɔkɔ ko akimanaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lewi abɔngedjaka boyaka bopele ta ndako e nde; ko emumu e baputedji ba puti ko bato bakina badaka ta mesa na bu. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Endolo Bapalusai na balehi ba mobeko badaka ena ko babalaka na manungunungu na ba batingami ba nde: «Tina ndani ino wayakani ko wamwakani na baputedji ba puti na bato ba babe?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Editi na bato badi na mikuku bopele te bahombe monganga, endolo bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Naidua ahomba bato ba bodjo, endolo nadua ahomba bato babe bɛngi bahombedje mida mi bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko miongɔnɔ mi bokia</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2, 18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bapalusai na balehi ba mobeko babalaka na nde: «Batingami ba Yoane pongono na bapalusai badaka na miongɔnɔ mi bokia mbala na mbala. Endolo batingami ba wɛ bakayake ko bakamwake.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Oboanini bokiedja bato ibabeami ta tɛkɛ emoki mia ma boyaka ta ehole edi momi na bu engbanga? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Masu maduake, ehole ebakinabi momi o moki; ta masu mamina, bakiabi busa bomina.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu abalaka na bu isɛ idi: «Moto taale epasa e esendja eyanie tine botonga na esendja eyou; tengasa alake esendja eyanie ngasa ko esendja eyanie etaputuana na esendja eyou. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Moto taisake vino eyanie ta mbola eyou, tengasa vino eyanie eboani bobatodja mbola ko vino eboani bosopea. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Endolo vino eyanie eboani na mbola eyanie! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Moto tapale bomwaka vino eyanie ngɔngɔ ibomwa vino eyou.Tengasa babalake: “Vino eyou edi epele.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2, 23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Busa bomɔti bo sabata Yesu akatisaka gbie e mbuma i bule. Batingami ba nde badaka babuka mingbɔndu mi bule,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bule edi mbuma i kokani na mbuma i ndongo, batingami ba nde babukaka mbuma i bule, badjiminaka na mɔmɔ ma bobo tina e badie mbuma i boya.</char></note> badjisianaka na mɔmɔ ma bobo ko badaka badjiyaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mo ebole okina o bapalusai babalaka: «Tina ndani wakɔkɔni midjɔ misiama ta busa bo sabata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 34, 21.</char></note>?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Oilangani imi mikɔ Dapiti, ehole eoka yo ndja, yo na bato badaka na nde? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Akweaka ta Ndako e Ndjakomba, atombaka miɛmbɛ imibondjeaka bo Ndjakomba, amiyaka.» Ko amipaka pongono adi bia badalaka na nde, dongedja oko banganga ba Ndjakomba baboanaka bomiyaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">atomba miɛmbɛ imibudjea bo tine Ndjakomba </char><char style="fp" closed="false">endja ta 1 Sa 21, 2-7.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ko abalaka na bu: «Mwana o Moto adi mokondji o busa bo sabata.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moto o ebɔ eondɔke</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />A isu ikina i sabata, Yesu akweaka ta sinagoga tine boleha. Edaka oho moto omɔti etumbɛ o ebɔ eondɔke. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Balehi ba mobeko na bapalusai badaka baendja Yesu na miso mabe, tine boendja kaoko aboani boheledja moto ta busa bo sabata, tengasa badaka bamohomba na modjɔ mo bomopunda. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Endolo yo adjebaka malɛi ma bobo; abalaka na moto odaka etumbɛ o ebɔ eondɔke: «Angɔ, kɛ aemae ta boso bo bato.» Asangɔdjɔkɔ ko aemaka ta boso bo bato. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesu abalaka na bu nadi na ihɔdjɔ i bohɔdjɔni: «Esiama ta isu i sabata nde? Bokɔ bopele kaoko bokɔ bobe, boheledja mohelo mo moto kaoko bomobungedja.» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Na bea, Yesu abaendjaka bo basusu, abalaka na moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko abala ngɔngɔ na moto </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ta makomi makina mabalaka boo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">abalaka na kɛlɛ adi moto.</char></note> etumbɛ o ebɔ eondɔke: «Ninɔdja ebɔ.» Aeninodja, ko ebɔ e nde ehelaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Endolo balehi ba mobeko ko bapalusai balumaka na kɛlɛ ko basabaleanaka ta tei e bobo modjɔ moboani na su bokɔ tina e Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahɔi batingami domi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3, 13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ta masu mia, Yesu akɛkɛ ta ikoli tine bongɔnɔ, anɔdjɔkɔ bulu bosusu ta bongɔnɔ Ndjakomba <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ehole eya busa, abeaka batingami ba nde ko, ahɔi domi na babae, ababeaka na kombe e bapɔsɔlu: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simo obakeaka yo kombe Piɛlɛ, Andele, mwange nde, Djake, Yoane, Pilipo, Batelemi; <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo, Toma, Djake, mwana o Alipe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Djake mwana o Alepe.</char></note>, Simo, obeaka bo Djelote; <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda, mwana o Djake, ko Yudasi Isikaliota, yona oimeaka molɔngi.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi emumu e bato ko aheledji bato ba bipeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu atitaka na bu nase i ikoli, baemaka ta polo ebhuda. Emumu e batingami ko emumu e bato baduaka adi yo: badongaka ta Yudea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elenge ta Luk 1, 5, </char><char style="fp" closed="false">atingodjaka napɛ kitɛ ibonga esusu e palesitina.</char></note> esusu, ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko na mabonga masusu madaka ta mokula moduwa enɛnɛ, e ngondo e Tula na Sidona. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Baduaka tine bomoka na bomohɔdjɔ abaheledjaka na bego i bobo. Ibia batungeamaka na miembo mibe bahelaka. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Moto na moto ta emumu apalaka oko amopee, tengasa ngulu eimaka adi yo ko ebaheledjaka bo basusu.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sepi ko ndjokwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Na bea, Yesu aendjaka batingami ba nde ko abalaka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Sepi adi no batakeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">tengasa Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodi tine bino!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Sepi adi no badi na ndja edɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">tengasa ogolabini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Sepi, adi no bayeaka edɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">tengasa osɛkɛbini!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Sepi ta ehole eokeinibo swɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">Ehole enɛkɛnibo ngasa ko bosingakabini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">Ehole eobenganabinibo ko bokoseabini midjɔ misusu mibe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">Ta tina e mbi Mwana o Moto.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Sepani ko daani na sepi ehole akokedjamake meako mimina; tengasa iputi inɛnɛ idi ibombamake tine bino o diko. Edi oko bea bakɔkɔ ba bobo banɔngedjaka ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 kol 36, 16; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bik 7, 52.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Endolo ndjokwa, na nu badieli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">tengasa opelini bodieli bo bino!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ndjokwa na nu bia bagoli edɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">tengasa waokakeni ndja!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ndjokwa na nu bia badi bosɛkɛ edɛdi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">tengasa wadake ta ilaka ko wayeakeni!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ndjokwa na nu bato basusu babalaka bopele na tina e bino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">Tengasa bakɔkɔ ba bobo banɔngedjaka ba mbaeli ba boloa!<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epaeli ta pamba e baloni</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5, 38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7, 12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Endolo nabali na nu, ino bia baokakani: palani baloni ba bino, kɔni bopele na bia baokeakani swɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Djongoani bia baolakedjakani, ongɔnɔni Ndjakomba tine bia baonɔngedjakani. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Moto akoboma epapata ta mobanga momɔti, mopa mobanga mokina. Moto akatomba mokoto mo wɛ, mokinea ko simisi <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Pa adi moto yona ahɔdjɔkɔ; iyona oandoi eka e wɛ, pɛ bomohɔdjɔ aesɔmbedje. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Misusu mikapaleno boo bato bakina bokɔmeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bal 13, 8-10.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Okapaleni oko bia bakopaleni, tina nda odi boamba ikabo itikoanake? Bato ba babe bakapale pongono bia ba kabapale. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ko ekadabo okɔi bopele na bia bakokɔmeni bopele, tina ndani odini boamba ikabo itikoanake? Bato babe bakakɔe pongono ko bea. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Endolo okabekedjani oko adi bato bia badi na nu na ndingo e bosɔmbedjani, tina dani odini boamba ikabo itikoanake? Bato ba babe bakasabekedjane pongono bɛngi ba sasɔmbedjeane. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Endolo ino palani baloni ba bino bakɔmeakani bopele, okababekedjani leka lo bino pɛ bobaputedjani ikabo i bino ladake inɛnɛ. Ibea wadakeni bana ba Yona odi odiko i losusu, tengasa adi mopele na bato bia tebadime bopele bokabakɔe bo ko na bato babe. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Okeakani bato ndjokwa, elenge Sange e bino akokeyo bato ndjokwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 34, 6, </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ndj 86, 15.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pɛ bosambedjani bato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Pɛ bosambedjani bato ko Ndjakomba ato sambedjabini; pɛ bodumba bato na midjɔ ko Ndjakomba atodumbabini; yɛni bato na midjɔ ko Ndjakomba aoyɛbini. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Pani bato leka ko Ndjakomba aopabini. Alumedjabi mabenga ma bino botɔɔ bosopeana. Ndjakomba aengɛbini na mwɛngi oko elenge akaengɛ wɛ bato bakina.<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu abalaka na bu isɛ imɔti: «Moto o gwa miso aboani bodaledja minande ogwa miso? Akakɔ bea, bo basusu babae bakwake ta mombɔndɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Motingami aboaniti bonɔ molehi o nde; endolo moikoi yona oikoi bopele adake elenge molehi o nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Tina nda wenɛkɛ ebumbu edi ta diso i mwange e wɛ, enakobea otaenɛkɛ ibaya idi ta diso i wɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Mondumbandani moboani na wɛ botɔndea mwange e wɛ: “Maninga, amba nodongedje ebumbu edi ta diso i wɛ,” endolo wɛ otenɛkɛ ibaya idi ta diso i wɛ. Ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Dongedja boso ibaya idi ta diso i wɛ, ko wenɛke bopele ta boso bo mwange e wɛ boo odongedje ebumbu ta diso i nde.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mole ko mbuma i nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12, 33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Mole mopele temobote mbuma ibe ko mole mobe temobote mbuma ipele. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Mole na mole mokadjebane na mbuma i yu, tebabuke mbuma i pigi ta ipumba i ndjubɛ ko pongono tebatswɛ mbuma i vino ta mole mondjube. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Moto mopele akainedje meako mipele imibolama ta molema mo nde, moto mobe akainedje meako mibe imibolama ta molema mo nde. Tengasa monɔkɔ mo moto na moto mokaimedje imiluma ta molema mo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndako ibae</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Tina ndani okabenini “Kumu, Kumu”, ko tokɔeni meako mi mbi? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Napalaka noinedjeni moto oboani bodua adi mbi, aoki meako mi mbi ko amisi ta mosala aboani na nda: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Moto omina aboani na moto yona opikaka ndako: alongaka mombɔndɔ mombɛngɛ ko angɔdjɔkɔ moboko diko i mabanga. Ehole edua pela, madiba malinda ndako, endolo ndako eikwa tine boo aepika bopele. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Endolo moto yona oki meako mi mbi ko amisiti ta mosala aboani na moto yona opika ndako e nde ta kpɔtɔ, apika makwe ta mabanga. Ehole ekweaka madiba ta ndako emina, mbala emɔti ekwaka, ko ndako emina ebeha esusu mɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mosali o mokondji o basoda</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8, 5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ehole esidjaka Yesu bobala meako mimina misusu na emumu e bato emohikaka, ayanaka ta Kapalanauma. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Oho, kapitɛne o basoda mokama o Loma adaka na mosali o nde omɔti yona opalaka yo mɛnɛ. Mosali omina adaka apeka na yogo mbuti na bogwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Ehole eokaka kapitɛni bobala na tina e Yesu, alomaka bakumu ba Bayuda adi Yesu boo bamotɔnde adue aheledja mosali o nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ehole eimeaka bakumu ba Bayuda adi Yesu, bomongɔnɔkɔ mɛnɛ ko babalaka: «Moto omina aboani na wɛ omokamoe, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Tengasa akapale bato ba biso ko edi yo moto olotongea sinagoga e biso.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Na bea Yesu akɛkɛ na bu engbanga emɔti. Ehole eimeakabo mbuti na ndako e kapitɛne o basoda mokama o Loma, alomaka babinande boo batɔnde Yesu: «Kumu, pɛ bosatungea mbi nabosaniti boo okwe ta ndako e mbi. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Edi na tina emina, napalakiti mbi mɛnɛ bodua adi wɛ. Endolo bala oko kɔpi emɔti, mosali o mbi ahelake. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Mbi mɛnɛ, nadi na bakondji bia bakasume mbi, nadi na basoda pongono bakasumeni. Nakabala na omɔti: “kɛ!”, Akɛi; nakabala na okina: “Dua!”, Adoi; ko nakabala na mosali o mbi: “Ko bo!”, Akɔi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ehole eokaka Yesu mibalo mimina, asepaka na nde mɛnɛ. Ahombanaka adi emumu e bato bamokimanaka ko abalaka: «Notɔndeakani: “Nongo ta Isalɛlɛ, naipakenɛ moto o bodima moda mu!”»<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ehole eyanaka bato balomaka kapitɛni bataneaka ta ndako, mosali omina amahela.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asisodji mwana yona ogwaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Aya busa Yesu akɛkɛ ta ibonga imɔti na kombe e Naine. Batingami ba nde na emumu e bato bakɛkɛ na nde engbanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ehole eimeaka yo mbuti na modipe mo ibonga, basakanaka na bato bakɛ apusea mwana omɔti ogwaka. Mwana momi adaka o ikinda, o mwali ogwa na momi. Ko bato banɛnɛ ba ibonga imina badaka na nde engbanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Oko ta ehole emoenɛkɛ Kumu, ko amokeaka ndjokwa enɛnɛ. Abalaka na nde: «Kina boeya!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ko Yesu abatamaka mbuti, apeaka mosongo, ko bato iba songaka baemaka. Yesu abalaka: «Mwenga, nabali na wɛ, angɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Mwana yona ogwaka asisoa; adaka na mobondo ko abangaka bobala. Yesu amopaka adi nange e nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bato basusu balumaka na bɔɔ, ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba babalaka: «Mbaeli o Ndjakomba monɛnɛ aimi ta ibonga i biso!» Ko pongono: «Ndjakomba adoi akɔmedja bato ba nde!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Gala e meako imikɔ Yesu enanganaka ta Yudea esusu ko ta ngando i mbuti mbuti.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11, 2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Batingami ba Yoane bamotɔndeaka midjɔ iminɔkɔ misusu. Ibea Yoane abeaka batingami ba nde babae, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />ko abalomaka adi Kumu Yesu bɛngi bamohɔdje: «Edi wɛ Masiya, yona oboani bodua kaoko loboani boamba moto okina?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ehole eimeaka bo adi Yesu, babalaka na nde: «Yoane Mobatisi alolomi adi wɛ tine lohɔdje: “Edi wɛ, yona aduake kaoko eboani na su boamba moto okina?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu aheledjaka bato banɛnɛ ba bego, bitumbɛ, bato badaka na miembo mibe ko bato ba miso mago banɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Na bea Yesu ayanedjaka bato ibalomaka Yoane: «Kɛni amotɔndeni imi misusu mieni no ko miokino: bato iba bagwa miso baeni, bitumbɛ ibaondɔ mako badali, bato ba bohoka booki, bato ba mabha basɛnɔi, bato ibagwa basombi ta bomɔ, ko Bwɛndi Bopele batɔndeamaka adi batakeli. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Sepi adi moto wadake pɛ boda ibaku tina e mbi!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ehole eyanaka bato ibalomaka Yoane, Yesu abangaka botɔndea bato banɛnɛ ta tina e Yoane. Abalaka: «Okɛkini ta etengelenge aendja nda? Mososongo mokumani na mopɛpɛ? Ngasa? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Emitida bea okɛkɛni aendja mɛnɛ nda? Moto yona oloaki bisendja bi gala? Ngasa, bato ibakalwae bisendja bi gala bakahele ta bodieli bakadae ta ndako i bakondji. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ibea okɛkini mɛnɛ aendja nda? Mbaeli o Ndjakomba omɔti? Soti, notɔndeini, yona anɔi nongo mbaeli o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Edi tina e Yoane ekomama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">“Nalomi ta boso bo wɛ molomami o mbi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">Ebɛngi abɔngedje ndjea e wɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />«Nabali na nu, ta ndanda e bato babotama na mwali, pɛ moto onɔi Yoane na bonɛnɛ; enakobea, yona odi mokɛkɛ bonɔ ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba adi monɛnɛ bonɔ yo. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Bato basusu na baputedji ba puti ibamokaka badimaka boo Ndjakomba adi bodjo ko badima boinama na ndjea e Yoane. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Endolo Bapalusai ko balehi ba mobeko balonaka bibɔngedji bi Ndjakomba ta tina e bobo, baidimaka boinama na Yoane.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu abalaka naikina: «Naboani bokokanedja bato ba ehole ye na nda? Baboani na ba nda? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Baboani na bana bia badi na mobondo ta polo e bhuda, basayeanaka bo na ibo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">“Lohueyaka piololo, oibuwani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Loembaka ndjembo indjokwa, oiyeani!”<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Tengasa, Yoane Mobatisi aduaka, aiyakaka miɛmbɛ ko aimwaka mana ma vino. Obalakani bo? Obalakani: “Adi na mwembo mobe!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Iya adua Mwana o Moto, ayaka mia, amwaka vino ko obalakani: “Adi na posa eboyaka ko bomwaka vino, adi mwange e baputedji ba puti ko bato babe!” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Endolo djebeli e Ndjakomba bodjebani edi bodjo ta pamba e bato basusu bia bakamodime.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta ndako e Simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mopalusai omɔti amobeaka bo akayaka mia ta ndako e nde, akweaka ta ndako emina ko adaka ta mesa tine boyaka. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ta ibonga imina edaka na, mwali omɔti o mabe. Ehole aokaka yo boo Yesu adi ta ndako e Mopalusai, aduaka na molangi molumake na malasi ma motuya monɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Adaka mbuti na mako ma Yesu, aeyaka, ko mbisoli i nde, ipoedjaka mako ma Yesu. Adaka ahakoa mako ma Yesu na swe i nde ko amabhimbaka eni amasopea malasi mamina. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ehole enɛkɛ Mopalusai yona obeaka Yesu bea, asabaleaka: «Esedabo moto iyo adi soti mbaeli o Ndjakomba, aboanaki adjebe mɛnɛ moda mo mwali iyo osapea boo adi mwali o gala ebe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu abalaka na Mopalusai: «Simo, nadi na meako mibobala na wɛ», «Molehi, bala.» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Ko Yesu abalaka: «Moto omɔti abekedjaka bato babae bibende bi pata. Moto o boso aboanaka bosɔmbedja motuya mo bibende bi pata mikama mitano; okina, motuya mo bibende bi pata tuku itano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ibea pɛ nongo moto omɔti ta ndanda e bobo aidaka na enɔi e boputa nyongo e nde. Ta tei e bobo babae, omopalabi mɛnɛ nda?»<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simo asɔmbedjaka: «Nalɛdji edi yona odi na nyongo enɛnɛ.» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Wɛ olongi.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yesu ahombanaka adi mwali ko abalaka na Simo: «Wɛ oeni mwali iyo? Nakwei ta ndako e wɛ; wɛ opitini madiba ma bososa na mako; endolo yo, asosi mako ma mbi na mbisoli i nde ko adji hakoi na swe i nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wɛ obhimbitini endolo yo, donga akweaki mbi ta ndako wɛ, akiniti bobhimba mako ma mbi <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Osopeitini malasi ta molo mo mbi endolo yo, asopeini malasi ta mako ma mbi. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Edi tina e mina notɔndeaka bo mabe ma nde masusu mayɛmi, tine bo ainedjini epaeli enɛnɛ. Endolo ta pamba e moto oyɛi bo na nyongo ekɛkɛ ainedjabi epaeli ekɛkɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ibea Yesu abalaka na mwali omina: «Mabe ma wɛ mayɛmi.» <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bato bia badaka na nde bayaka mia ta mesa baimeaka bosabaleana ta tei e milema mi bobo! «Asenɛkɛ nda ebɛngi ayɛ mabe ma bato?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na mwali omina: «Edimeli e wɛ eoheledji. Kɛɛ na bogo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bali bapakeaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Yesu akɛkɛ ta mabonga manɛnɛnɛ na ta mabonga makɛkɛkɛ, tine botɔndɔ ko boleha Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Batingami domi na babae bamopakeaka, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />engbanga emɔti na bali bia bahelaka na membo mibeko na bego i bobo: Malia, yona obeaka bo Magadala, yona oimedjaka bo membo mibe sambo, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yoana, mwali o Kudja, mobanei o leka lo Elode; Susani ko bato bakina banɛnɛ, bia badaka bakɔmedja ko bakamoa Yesu na batingami ba nde.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i moneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk 4, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Emumu e bato babolamaka mbuti na Yesu, donga ta mabonga tungu na tungu. Abalaka na bu isɛ di: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />Moto omɔti akɛkɛ amɛsɛ mbuma ta gbie, ehole edaka yo amɛsɛ mbuma, ikina mbuma ikwaka ta ndjea: bato baidalakaka ko mbulu badiko baikoma. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ikina mbuma ikwaka ta mabanga: itɔkɔ endolo ikakanaka tine taka e madiba. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ikina mbuma ikwaka ta tei e nginga i ndjubɛ: ibangaka botɔ, engbanga emɔti na ndjubɛ ko imbambamedja. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Endolo, mbuma ikina ikwaka ta mokpɔtɔ mopele: djitɔkɔ ibotaka mingbɔndu djimedjaka mbuma mokama. Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka: «Iyona odi na matoi ma boka, aoke!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina nda Yesu abalaka na masɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4, 10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Batingami ba Yesu bamohɔdjɔkɔ abatingodje tina e isɛ imina. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Ino oboanini bodjeba mbombi i Bokumu bo Ndjakomba, endolo tina e bato bakina badi bomoka na moda mo masɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">“Na bea, baboani boendja endolo pɛ boenɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">baboani boka endolo pɛ bodjeba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 6, 9</char></note>” »<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodji isɛ i moneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4, 13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Endjani tina e isɛ imina: mbuma edi mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Bato bakina baboani na ndjea ta polo ekwi mbuma: baoki mobalo, endolo Satana adoi abakatoi mobalo ta milema mi bobo, tine bobasia boo badime basakahela. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Bato bakina badi oko moda mo kpɔtɔ i mabanga: baoki mobalo ko bamodimi na sepi. Endolo mbuma imina imedja nginga, badimi ta mo ehole mokɛkɛ, endolo ta ehole e saya, babosani edimeli. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Esika yena ekwaka mbuma ta ndjubɛ, eboani na bato baoki mobalo. Endolo bakina baisi malɛno, ta bodieli ko na posa e bomɔ bo busa na busa, bombambamedja mobalo mo mina. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Mbuma djia ikwaka ta mokpɔtɔ mopele, eboani na bato bia baoki mobalo, bamobanei ta milema bopele na sepi ko mobotaka mbuma djipele tine ingbangba i bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i molinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk 4, 21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Moto tabwanedje molinda tine amodipe na poke kaoko tine bomoisa ta nase i bokaki. Enakobea, bomosɛpeaka ta esɛpɛi e molinda tine bato bia bokweaka ta ndako baenɛ bohu. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Misusu mimbombi mienɛmɛbi ta bhuda, misusu mi kuku midjebanabi ta bohu. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Dani na engɛlɛ na moda mokakano! Tengasa moto yona odi na eka, bamopabi lokina, endolo yona odi pɛ eka, bamokatoabi nongo moeka olɛdjɛkɛ yo bo adi na yu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nange Yesu ko bangi nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3, 31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nango na ba ngɔngɔ i Yesu bamokimanaka ta ibonga idaka yo, endolo baidiaka enɔi e boimea ta polo edaka yo, tine emumu e bato. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Bato batɔndeaka Yesu: «Nange wɛ na bangi wɛ badi sokolu, bapalaka boenɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka bato bamina: «Nange mbi na bange i mbi edi bato bokaka mobalo mo Ndjakomba ko bamoisaka ta mosala.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asi mopɛpɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4, 35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu akweaka ta bwato yo na batingami ba nde abalaka na bu: «Lokatiseni ta dɔngɔ i ibeke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibeke ibali boo edi ibeke i Genesaleta. Dɔngɔ li kɛkɛ bo idaka na bato badaka pɛ boda Bayuda.</char></note>.» Ibea bakatisaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ta ehole edaka bo baluke bwato, Yesu ahwɛkɛ. Na mbala emɔti, lungu epipo ebangaka bokumba ta ibeke; mbunoko madiba maimeaka boluma ta bwato baokaka mongangale. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ibea batingami basalindaka mbuti na Yesu bamosisodjaka eni bagama: «Molehi, Molehi, lahombaka logwɛ!» Yesu, asisoaka, agameaka lungu na mbonge: losusu lopɔpɔnɔkɔ wai. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ibea Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Bodima bo bino bodi djɔ?» Balumaka na bɔɔ ko na bokamoa. Baimeka bosahɔdjɔnɔ: «Moto iyo adi nda? Abalaka na lungu, na mbonge ko bomosuma!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto odaka na miembo mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5, 1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Baimeaka ta dɔngɔ i ngando e Gelasa, ena edaka ta pamba e ibeke iyɛlɛmɛni na Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ehole eduboaka Yesu o ngondo, momi omɔti o ibonga imina aduaka asakana na nde. Momi omina adaka na miembo mibe donga ehele, ailwaka bisendja aidaka ta ndako, endolo ahelamaka ta makila. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ehole enɛkɛ yo Yesu, asadumbaka ta mako ma nde ko alɛbɛkɛ na moholi mopipo: «Eka apalaka wɛ na mbi nda, Yesu, Mwana o Ndjakomba onɔi odiko li losusu? Nongɔni, pɛ botungeani!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Tengasa Yesu abalaka na mwembo mobe moime adi yo. Mwembo momina modaka momodumba mbala na mbala; bamonangaka mɔmɔ na mako na sɛni tine bomobanea, endolo adjilenakaka ko mwembo mobe momolomaka ta bisika bi etengelenge. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kombe e wɛ nda?» Amosɔmbedjaka: «Kombe e mbi Banɛnɛ.» Tengasa miembo mibe minɛnɛ mikweaka na nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ko miembo mibe mimina miongɔnɔkɔ Yesu boo adae pɛ bomiloma ta mombhɔndɔ mo modidi mombɛngɛ mo mopɛ suka.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Bwela bonɛnɛ bo ngulu bodaka ena bayaka ta ikoli. Miembo mibe miongɔnɔkɔ Yesu amipɛ ndjea mikwe ta bwela bo ngulu. Ibea Yesu abapaka enɔi. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Miembo mibe mimaka adi moto omina ko mikweaka ta bwela bo ngulu. Ibea bwela bo ngulu bomina bodjilimoanaka donga ta ikoli odiko ko bodindaka ta madiba ma ibeke.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ehole enɛkɛ babanei ba ngulu modjɔ momina, ko bapotaka ko bakɛkɛ atɔndɔ midjɔ mimina ta ibonga i Gelesaleta ko ta mabonga makɛkɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bato baduaka tine bokokoledja modjɔ imu mosakɔmɔkɔ. Ehole eimeakabo mbuti na Yesu ko bataneaka moto yona ohela na miembo mibe adi na mobondo ta mako ma Yesu; alwaka bisendja ko asɔmbɔ bopele, bato basusu babangaka. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bato baɛnɛkɛ modjɔ momina, batɔndeaka binabu moda mohela moto yona odaka na miembo mibe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ibea bato basusu ba ibonga imina bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu adonge ta ibonga i bobo, tengasa baimeaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ. Yesu atiteaka ta bwato bɛngi akɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Ibea moto yona ohelaka na miembo mibe aɔngɔnɔkɔ Yesu boo akɛ na nde engbanga emɔti. Endolo Yesu amoyanedjaka ko abalaka: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Yana ta ibota i wɛ ko tɔndɔ meako misusu miokɔmei Ndjakomba.» Moto omina akɛkɛ, abalaka ko atɔndɔkɔ bato ba ibonga isusu meako mikɔ Yesu tina e nde.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana o Yailo na mwali opea esendja e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5, 21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ta ehole esɔmbɔkɔ Yesu ta dongɔ ikina ibeke, emumu e bato bamaosɔkɔ, tengasa bo basusu badaka bomoamba. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Moto omɔti aduaka yana kombe e nde Yailo. Adaka mokondji o Ndako e Ndjakomba. Akwaka magbundɔ ta mako ma Yesu, amongɔkɔ boo adue ta ndako e nde, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />tengasa adaka oko na mwana o nde mwali omɔti, yona adaka apeka mbuti na bogwa ko adaka mbuti na mbula domi na babae.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ehole edaka Yesu bokɛ oho emumu e bato badaka bamolindakake mɔngɔ masusu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Edaka mwali omɔti adaka apeka na epeko e botanga makia mbuti na mbula domi na babae. Asidjaka bodieli bosusu bo nde adi minganga, endolo pɛ nongo omɔti o bomoheledja. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Asalindaka ta sangɔngɔ i Yesu, apeaka molenda mo esendja e nde, ko gbundumo makia makinaka botanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu ahɔdjɔkɔ: «Opeini nda?» Baidimaka bo basusu ko Piɛlɛ abalaka: «Molehi, edɛdi bato banɛnɛ bia baohiki ko baohineakaka.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Endolo Yesu abalaka: «Moto omɔti apeini, tengasa naoki ngulu emɔti eimi ta tei e mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Yana adjebaka mwali omina boo aditi naikina mobombamake, abangi bodjoa ko akwaka na magbundɔ ta mako ma Yesu. Atɔndeaka Yesu ta boso bo bato basusu tina emopeaka yo, ko moda mohela yo na yogo e nde oko ta ehole emina. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Mwana o mbi mwali, edimeli e wɛ eoheledji. Kɛ na bogo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Oko ehole ebalaka Yesu bea, moto omɔti adongi ta ndako e mokondji o sinagoga, ko abali na nde: «Mwana o wɛ o mwali agwi. Pɛ botungea naikina molehi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Endolo Yesu aoka yo meako mimina, abalaka na Yailo: «Pɛ bobanga, dima oko bodima, ko mwana ahelake.» <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ehole eimeaka Yesu ta ndako e Yailo, aidimaka moto omɔti akwe na nde dongedjako Piɛlɛ, Yoane, Djake, na Sange e mwana na nange e mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bato basusu badaka boeya ko bosadumbakaka tina e nde. Yesu abalaka: «Pɛ boeyani agwiti ahwɛi hiɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Endolo bato badaka bomosɛkɛ, tengasa badjebaka bo mwana agwi ehele. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Endolo Yesu, amopeaka ta ebɔ e nde, amobei na moholi mopipo: «Mwana o mbi, angɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Mwana mwali omina asɔmbɔkɔ ta mohelo oko ta ehole emina, Yesu abalaka na baboti ba nde bamopɛ mia. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Baboti ba nde akamoaka mɛnɛ, endolo Yesu abalaka boo badae pɛ botɔndea moto omɔti modjɔ imu mosakɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Elomu e Batingami domi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10, 5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6, 7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu abeaka batingami ba nde domi na babae, ko abapaka kpatsi e bobengana miembo mibe, na boheledja bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Abalomaka bodjebedja Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na boheledja bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Ko abatɔndeaka: «Pɛ botombani eka emɔti tine mɔndɔ: Pɛ pango, pɛ sɛki, pɛ mwɛmbɛ, pɛ palanga ko moto omɔti pɛ botomba bisendja bibae. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Bakoasɔni ta ndako emɔti, dani ena mbunoko okakinani polo emina. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Endolo bamiti oasɔni, dongani ta ibonga i bobo, ko bhubholani dutu i mako ma bino: adake embete e sambi e bobo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Batingami bakɛkɛ ko badaka banɔe ta ngando isusu boleha Bwɛndi Bopele ko boheledja bato ba bipeko pamba isusu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elode asatungei</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6, 14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Elode, Gupɛnɛlɛ, aokaka gala e meako misusu mibalaka bo ko aimeaka bosatungea, tengasa bato bakina babalaka: «Yoane Mobatisi asapusoaka ta tei e bago.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bato bakina badaka babala: «Elia aimani.» Bato bakina badaka babala: «Edi omɔti o ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba bayou apusoi ta tei e bago.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Endolo Elode abalaka: «Edi Yoane Mobatisi yona olenedjaka mbi molo, apusoi! Moto omina nda wokaka mbi akɔkɔ midjɔ imi misusu adi mɛnɛ nda?». Na bea ahombaka aenɛ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayedji bato bonɔ koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bapɔsɔlu bahulaka ko batɔndeaka Yesu meako misusu mikɔkɔ bo. Yesu abatombaka ko akɛkɛ na bu basadea bo bɛnɛ mbuti na ibonga ibeaka bo Betesaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Endolo emumu e bato badjebaka bea, bamokimanaka. Yesu abasɔkɔ, abalehaka Bwɛndi bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na aheledjaka bia badaka na posa e mohelo. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Busa bobangaka botita, batingami domi na babae basalindaka mbuti na Yesu ko bamotɔndeaka: «Yanedja bato, bakɛ awɛɛ ta mabonga na ta mako imi madi mbuti mbuti ko bahombe mia, tengasa lodi iya ta etengelenge.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Endolo yo abalaka na bu: «Ino bɛnɛ bapani mia!» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Lodi oko na miɛmbɛ mitano na swi babae. Bala bo lokɛ asomba mia tina e bato ibi basusu!» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Bato badaka ena bonɔ mbuti na koto itano. Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Badedjani na mobondo bibole tuku itano tuku itano.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Batingami basumaka ko bakɔkɔ oko bea. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu atombaka miɛmbɛ mitano na swi babae. Angɔdjɔkɔ miso o diko ko apaka Ndjakomba mɛlɛsi tine leka lomina. Amapaka adi batingami ba kabane emumu bato. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bato basusu bayaka ko bagolaka. Bandoanaka bikengakengi bia bidikaka ko balumedjaka mitinga domi na babae.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ adjebedji Yesu adi Kilito</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16, 13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk 8, 27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu aongɔnɔkɔ asatswa na bu ko batingami ba nde badaka engbanga na nde. Yo abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Bato bakabale mbi nadi nda?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Bato bakina bakabale boo wɛ odi Yoane Mobatisi, bakina ko wɛ odi Elia, na bakina bakabale odi omɔti o ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ibayou opusoa.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />«Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: ibea ta tina e bino, okabaleni mbi nadi nda?» Piɛlɛ amosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ odi Kilito o Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi bogwa na bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16, 20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu abakebedjaka mɛnɛ badae pɛ botondea moto. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu abakeaka: «Eboani bo Mwana o Moto aoke saya enɛnɛ. Basuku ba ibonga bamolone, bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba na balehi ba mobeko, bamodumbe bamowake ngɔngɔ isu i basato, apusoabi.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mondumba mo bokimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16, 20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Yesu abalaka na bu basusu: «Moto akapala bokimanani, asalone yo mɛnɛ atombe ekulusu e nde isu na isu ko akimaneni. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Tengasa moto opali boheledja bomɔ bo nde, abobungedjake; endolo yona wabungedjake bomɔ bo nde ta tina e mbi, aboheledjabi. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Tɛtɔ adiake moto nda ekadabo adie ngondo esusu ko abungedji kaoko akabedja mohelo mo nde? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Moto akokani sɔni ko na mibalo mi mbi, Mwana o Moto pongono amokabi sɔni ehole eduabi yo na ekumu e nde, na e kumu e Sango ko na babwɛndji basɛnɔke. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nabali na nu soti: bakina badi iya bagwɛtebi, boso bo baenɛ Bokondji bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose na Elia basoli na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk 9, 2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ngɔngɔ i meako mimina, enɔkɔ masu bomwambe, Yesu abaeka Piɛlɛ, Yoane na Djake; akɛkɛ na bu ta diko i ikoli tine bongɔnɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ehole edaka yo aongɔnɔ, boso bo nde bohombanaka moda mokina na bisendja bi nde bimeaka bipu ipɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Gbundumo bato babae badaka basolana na nde, edaka Mose ko Elia. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bahuamaka na ekumu e Ndjakomba. Badaka babala na Yesu tine mwɛngɔ mo nde mosuka, imua makokedjamake ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Piɛlɛ na binande bawɛkɛ hiɔ. Ehole esiswaka bo, baɛnɛkɛ ekumu e Ndjakomba ewhui Yesu na bami babae bia badaka na nde engbanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ehole egbɔtɔ bo na Yesu, Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Molehi, edi bopele lodae ya, lopike ndako isato: emɔti tine wɛ, emɔti tine Mose, emɔti tine Elia.» Enakobea Pielɛ aidjebaka meako mibalaka yo. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ehole edaka yo abala bea, itute imɔti iduaka bobahua. Batingami baokaka bɔɔ bonɛnɛ aenɛ boo itute bobahua. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Ko moholi momɔti moimaka ta itute bobala: «Iyo adi Mwana o Mbi, iyo ohɔi mbi, mokani!» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ehole esiaka moholi bobala, baenɛkɛ Yesu oko yo mɛnɛ. Ta ehole emina, batingami babombaka meako mimina ko baitɔndeaka nongo moto omɔti.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mwana odaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk 9, 14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Aya busa, bakinaka ikoli, emumu e bato baduaka asakana na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ta ndanda e bato bamina banɛnɛ, moto omɔti abangaka bogama: «Molehi, naongɔni, endja mwana o mbi, nadi na nde oko omɔti! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mbala isusu mwembo mobe mokamodumbe, ibea akaime bogama, mokamopukuse ko bosadumba ta kpɔtɔ, akaime boima masɔi ta monɔkɔ. Mwembo momina mokamokedje saya ko temomokine pɛpɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Naongɔnɔki batingami ba wɛ bamobengane, endolo bakokiti.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu abalaka: «Bato ba milema mipipo ko bataki bodjo! Mbunoko ehole nda edabi mbi na nu? Naohɔneni mbunoko ehole nda?» Abalaka na moto omina: «Dua na mwana o wɛ iya.» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Ehole aimeaka mwana mbuti na Yesu, mwembo mobe momopukusaka ko momodumbaka ta kpɔtɔ. Endolo Yesu abenganaka mwembo mobe momina, aheledjaka mwana ko amopaka adi sange e nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ko bato basusu bakamoaka na ngulu enɛnɛ e Ndjakomba.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu adjebedji tine bogwa bo nde</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ko moto na moto adaka bokamoa na misusu mikɔkɔ Yesu, atɔndeaka batingami ba nde: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Hokamedjani bopele meako midi mbi botɔndeani edɛdi: Mwana o Moto akabamake ta mɔmɔ ma bato.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Endolo baidjebaka mibalo mimina, tengasa midika Adibo mbombi tine baidjebaka eka epalaka Yesu bobala; ko babangaka bohɔdjɔ Yesu tina emina.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onɔi binande nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9, 33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Batingami badaka baboma kitɛ tine bodjeba: A ndanda e bobo, onɔi bina nde nda? <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu adjebaka midjɔ midaka bo balɛdjɛ, atombaka mwana mokɛkɛ omɔti, amoemeaka mbuti na nde, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ko abatɔndeaka boo: «Moto yona oasɔi mwana iyo ta kombe e mbi, asɔi mbi mɛnɛ, na yona oasɔini, asɔi yona olomakani, tengasa yona onɔi mokɛkɛ ta tei e bino, yo anɔi monɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yona odi pɛ bolonani edi tina e bino</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mlk 9, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yoane abalaka na Yesu: «Molehi, loenɛki moto omɔti adaki abengana membo mibe na kombe e wɛ lohombaka lomosie, tine aditi naiso engbanga.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Endolo Yesu amosombedjaka: «Pɛ bomosiani, moto yona odi pɛ bolonani, edi tina e bino.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngando emɔti e Samalia eloni boasɔ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ehole ebatamaka masu ma Yesu bokina ngondo ye, atombaka meko boo akɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Alomaka balomami boso bo nde. Bato bamina bakɛ ko bakweaka ta ngando emɔti e Samalia tine bomobongedja midjɔ misusu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Endolo bato ba ngando emina balonaka bomoasɔ, tine adaka akɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Ehole eokaka Djake na Yoane bea, babalaka: «Kumu, opali lobee mosa modonge o diko, motite ko mobedje bato bamina?»<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu ahombanaka tine bobaendja bopele ko abadosaka. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ko bakɛkɛ ta ngando ekina.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibia badima bokimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8, 19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ehole edaka bo na ndjea, moto omɔti abalaka na Yesu: «Kumu, mbi nokimanake ta bisika bisusu bakɛkɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Ebanga adi na makuku ko na mbulu ba diko badi na mopo; endolo mwana o moto yo aditi na polo e bosambea molo.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu abalaka na moto okina: «kimani» Endolo moto omina amosɔmbedjaka: «Kumu pani enɔi nakɛ apusea Sange e mbi boso.»<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Kina bago bapuse bago, endolo wɛ kɛ aleha Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Moto okina abalaka na Yesu: «Kumu, napalaka nokimane, endolo pani enɔi nakɛ boiseana na denga i mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu amosɔmbendjaka: «Molieli o gbie talɛ mɛngɛ sangɔngɔ. Akaedja ngɔngɔ aboaniti na Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Elomu e batingami tuku sambo na babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Kumu ahɔkɔ batingami bakina tuku sambo na babae ko abalomaka babae babae, boso bo nde, ta bisika bisusu ibipalaka yo bokɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Abatɔndeaka: «Mbuma ibobuka idi inɛnɛ ta gbie, endolo basali badi bakɛkɛ. Ongɔnɔni moswa gbie alome bakina basali ta gbie e nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Kɛni! Naolomini elenge bhata ta ndanda e swa. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Pɛ botombani ibenga i palanga, sɛki kaoko sapato. Pɛ boiseani moto na ndjea. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Okakweani ta ndako emɔti, balani boso boo: “Bogo bodae ta ndako ye.” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Moto o bogo akada ena, bogo bo bino badake adi yo; emiti da bea, bogo bo bino bosɔmbeakeni. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Dani ta ndako emina, yakani ko mwakani ilua lopakeni bo; tengasa mosali aboani na iputi i nde. Pɛ bokweanani ndako na ndako. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Okaimeani ta ibonga imɔti ko bakoasɔni, yakani mia maopakeni bo; <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />heledjani bato ba bipeko ba ngando yena ko balani na bato ba ngando emina: “Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimei mbuti na nu.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ehole ekweino ta ibonga imɔti, bamiti oasɔni kɛni ta ndjea e ibonga imina ko batɔndeani: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Dutu i ibonga i bino ikalimeaki ta mako ma biso, lodjibhubholi tine bosundoleani! Endolo, odjebeni bopele boo: Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimei mbuti.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nabali na nu: ehole esambedjabi Ndjakomba bato ba sɔdɔmɔ etumbo epabi yo bato bamina edabi epipo bonɔ bato ba Sɔdɔmɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngando i lona bodimea</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Ndjokwa na wɛ ibonga i Koladji! Ndjokwa na wɛ, ibonga i Betesaida! Tengasa, midjɔ mibokamoa imi makɔmɔkɔ adi no ekada mikɔmɔkɔ ta ibonga i Tula ko ta ibonga i Sidona, bato ba ibonga imina bapalaka bolwa sɛki na bada ta mihulu, tine boinedja boo bahombedja milema mi bobo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Na tina emina, ehole esambedjabi Ndjakomba bato, ibonga i Tula na i Sidona badiabi etumbo ekɛkɛ bonɔ no. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Ko wɛ ibonga i Kapalanauma, odi bolɛdjɛ boo okɛbi o diko? Otitabi mbunoko ta makila! <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu abalaka naikina na batingami ba nde: «Moto yona okeini, aokei mbi; yona olonini, aloni pongono mbi. Endolo yona olonini, aloni pongono mbi ko yona olomani.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule i batingami tuku sambo na babae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ehole, ehulaka batingami tuku sambo na babae, balumaka na sepi ko babalaka: «Kumu, nongo miembo mibe milosumi ta kombe wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Naenɛkɛ Satana bokwa ta kpɔtɔ donga o diko elenge mokalikali. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Endjani, naopini ngulu e bodala ndjɔ, na koolo, na ngulu isusu i moloni ko pɛ eka emɔti eboaniti bokɔni bobe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Enakobea, pɛ bosepani oto tine boo miembo mibe miosumi, endolo sepani bonɔ mɛnɛ kombe i bino ikakomami ta busa.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sepi e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu alumaka na sepi e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ko abalaka: Tata, Kumu o diko na ngondo, nokumedji; tine boo obombaka meako imi adi bato ba djebeli na bato ba bowɛi endolo omidjebedji na bato bakɛkɛkɛ. Tata, ta bwela bo wɛ, wadimaka boo edae oko ama wɛ bɔngedja.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />«Sange mbi apa midjɔ misusu ta mɔmɔ ma mbi. Pɛ moto omɔti odjebi Mwana, dongedja oko Sango; ko pɛ moto odjebi Sango, dongedja oko Mwana ko bato bia ibadima Mwana bobangɔdjɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ko Yesu ahombanaka ta pamba e batingami ba nde, abatɔndeaka oko bo mɛnɛ: «Sepi e miso mia maeni imi maenɛkɛno! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Tine boo, notɔndeini bohu: Ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba na bakondji banɛnɛ bahombaka boenɛ imi mienɛkɛno, endolo baimienɛ, bahombaka boka imi miokakano endolo baimioka.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mo Samalia mopele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Okina molehi o mobeko angɔkɔ tine bomeka Yesu. Abalaka na nde: «Molehi, nakɔe bo tine bodia bomɔ bo seko?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Ta buku e mobeko bakomi bo? Okamisipoe bo?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Amosɔmbedjaka: «“Pala Kumu Ndjakomba o wɛ na molema mo wɛ mosusu, na mwembo mo wɛ mosusu, na ngulu e wɛ esusu ko na malɛno ma wɛ masusu.” Ko pongono: “Pala mwange e wɛ oko elenge akasapale wɛ mɛnɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Ibea Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Osɔmbedji bopele. Kɔɔ oko bea odabi na bomɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 18, 5</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Endolo molehi o mobeko apalaka bosalongedja. Ibea ahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Mwange e mbi nda?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Moto omɔti adongaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ akɛkɛ ta ibonga i Yeliko. Na ndjea, asakanaka na bato babe ko bamopeaka, ba mokatoaka losusu lodaka na nde, bamobomakaka ko bakɛkɛ, bamokinaka mbuti na bogwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ekɔmɔkɔ na Nganga o Ndjakomba omɔti anɔkɔ ta ndjea emina, amoenɛkɛ ko amobambaka ta dɔngɔ i ndjea ekina ko akɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Molewi omɔti pongono aimeaka ta polo emina, amoenɛkɛ, amobambaka ta dɔngɔ i ndjea ekina ko akɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Endolo mo Samalia yona odaka akɛe mo nde mɔndɔ, aimeaka mbuti na moto omina: amoenɛkɛ ko amokeaka ndjokwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Asalindaka mbuti na nde, asosaka pola i nde, aisopeaka munɛ na mana ma vino ko anangaka bandi. Amobakeaka ta diko i punda o nde, akɛkɛ na nde ta ndako ekasɔebo bakɛndɛli oho amosaloaka bopele. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Aya busa, aiwaka denalio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Denalio edi na motuya mo iputi li moto o sali mosala isu isusu.</char></note> ibae, aipaka adi moto okabane ndako ekasɔe bo bakɛndɛli ko abalaka na nde: “Mosaloa, ta ihule i mbi, nosɔmbedjake djia djisusu iboani na wɛ bobakea.”»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesu abalaka: «A ndanda e bo basato, moto nda? Osinedja mwange e nde adi moto oboma bato babe nda?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Molehi o mobeko asɔmbedjaka: «Edi yona omokeaka ndjokwa.» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kɛɛ, wɛ ko kɔɔ oko bea.»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta ndako e Malia na Malata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Ta ehole edaka Yesu na batingami ba nde na ndjea, akweaka ta ngando emɔti ko mwali omɔti bamobeaka Malata amoasɔkɔ ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Yo adaka na mwange e nde o mwali kombe e nde Malia. Adaka na mobondo ta mako ma Kumu tine boka mibalo mi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Malata asatungeaka na mosala mo bokalea mia ta ndako. Aduaka ko abalaka: «Kumu, otaenɛkɛ bobe mwange e mbi mwali yana asundolini yo na misala misusu ta ndako? Mohɔdjɔ adoi akamoani.»<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Kumu amosɔmbedjaka: «Malata, Malata, odi bosatungea ko bosinedja saya tine meako minɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Endolo modjɔ monɔi na tina: Malia ahɔi ibondo inɔi na bopele, bamokatoetebi.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehi batingami ba nde miongɔnɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7, 7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Busa bo mɔti, Yesu aongɔnɔkɔ ta polo ekina. Ehole esidjaka yo, motingami omɔti amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, loleha moda mo bongɔnɔ, elenge Yoane alehaka yo batingami ba nde.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Ehole eongɔnɔkɔ no, balani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Sangwasu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">kinabo bato basusu badjebe odi Ndjakomba Mosɛnɔke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Bokumu bo wɛ bodue!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Lopa, engi busa, mia maboani na su.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Loyɛ mabe ma biso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Elenge akayɛso pongono adi bia bakalokɔe bobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Ko pɛ bololɔndɔ ta bomekama.” »<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu abalaka na bu naikina: «Ekadabo: omɔti ta ndanda e bino akada na mopalani, bea akɛi adi yo ta ndanda e bulu ko abali na nde: “Mopalani, bekedjani miɛmbɛ misato. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Omɔti o maninga o mbi aimeini naditi na eka e bomopa.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Bea yona odaka ta ndako, amosɔmbedja: “Kina botungeani! Ekukɛ edipami ehele, mbi na bana lowɛi, natabɔngɔ nagɔe tine bopa miɛmbɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nabali na nu, atangɔke tine bomopa miɛmbɛ elɔke adi mopalani o nde, endolo angɔke tine itungea i nde ko amopake eka akambaka na nde.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Na bea mbi, nabalaka na nu: sɛngɛni, baopakeni; hombani, wadiakeni; bomani, bodipoakeni. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Tengasa moto okahɔdje, akadie; yona okahombe, akenɛ; ko yona okabome bakamodipoe. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ta ndanda e bino omɔti akada sange moto, aboani bopa ibate adi mwana o nde ta ehole emohɔdji yo moswi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Kaoko, akahɔdjɔ itɔ, aboani bomopa koolo? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nongo ekada bea ino bato babe odjebini bopa bana ba bino leka lopele; edabi bo adi Sange bino yona odi ta busa, apɛtebi Mwembo Mosɛnɔke adi bia bakamohɔdje!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbedji tine pundi e nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12, 22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mlk 3, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Busa bomɔti Yesu abenganaka mwembo mobe imua moimedjaka momi omɔti emimi. Ehole eimaka mwembo mobe momina, emimi abalaka, emumu e bato bakamoaka. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Endolo ekenge e bato babalaka: «Edi Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ, mokondji o miembo mibe, yo moto okamopɛ ngulu ebobengana miembo mibe!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bakina, ta bopikea Yesu elambo babalaka: «kɔɔ embete boinedja boo ngulu e wɛ adongaka ta busa adi Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Endolo elenge Yesu adjebaka malɛnɔ ma bobo, abalaka na bu: Bokumu bosusu bokasakabane suka e bu bokanangane; ndako djimina djikakwɛ ta diko i ndako djikina. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ekada satana asakabani yo mɛnɛ, moda nda bokumu bo nde boboani boyeyoa? Obalini edi na ngulu e Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ abenganaka na mbi satana? <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Ko mbi nakabengane miembo mibe na ngulu e Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ, bana ba bino, ba kabengane na ngulu e nda? Na tina emina badabi bo bɛnɛ badjudji ba bino. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Endolo ekada na ngulu e Ndjakomba nakabengane miembo mibe, edi boo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bobatami mbuti na nu. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Ehole edi moto o ngulu na bipeko bi bila ta ndako e nde, leka lo nde losusu lodi ta e bana.<verse eid="LUK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Endolo moto omonɔi na ngulu akaimea akamolongea, amokatoake bipeko bi bila bisaki yo molema ko akabanake losusu lomokatoi yo.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />«Moto odi pɛ bopalani adi moloni o mbi; ko yona odi pɛ boda elenge mbi akakabane.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihule i mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«Ehole eimi mwembo mobe adi moto, mokɛi alebalebe ta etengelenge, bohomba polo e iheme. Endolo emiti dia, ekasabalei: “Nadoi asɔmbɔ ta ndako, yena eima mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ehole eimeake mo, ataneaka ndako eombɔmɔke edi ebɔngedjamake bopele. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ibea akɛke atomba miembo sambo mimonɔi na bobe; bakweake ta ndako ko badake ena. Suka, e moto yona edi boimea bobe bonɔ moda modaki yo boso.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odi moto omongandi nda?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ehole edaka Yesu abala meako mia, mwali omɔti ta emumu e bato agamaka: «Sepi adi mwali oloa demi i wɛ ko onungea mabɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Endolo Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Sepi edi adi bia bokaka mobalo mo Ndjakomba ko bamosaleaka.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdjɔ i embete e ngindola</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Elenge emumu e bato ehikaka Yesu, aimeaka bobala na bu: «Bato ba ehole ye badi babe. Bahɔdjɔkɔ embete e ngindola, endolo pɛ nongo embete e ngindola ekina ekɔmetebi; emitida oko embete e ngindola e Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Enakobea, Yona adaka embete tina e bato ba Niniwe, oko moda momina Mwana o moto adake embete tina e bato ba ehole ye. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Ta busa bo esambi, mokondji mwali o sude angɔbi engbanga na bato ba ehole ye ko abapundabi. Tine boo adonga ta suka e ngondo tine booka mibalo midjebeli e Salomo; enakobea iyo oemi ya anɔi Salomo na bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ta busa bo esambi, bato ba Niniwe bangɔbi ta boso bo bato ba ehole ye ko babapundabi. Tengasa bato ba Niniwe bahombedja mida ehole eokabo eleho e Yona. Ko enakobea odi ya anɔi Yona na bonɛnɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Molinda mo mokuku</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5, 15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6, 22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Moto omɔti ta bwanedje molinda tine bomobomba kaoko bomokunda na katini. Enako bea bakamosɛpɛe ta esɛpɛi tine bato bia bakweake ta ndako baɛnɛ bohu. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Miso ma wɛ madi molinda mo mokuku: Ehole edi miso ma wɛ bopele, mokuku mosusu modi ta bohu; endolo miso ma wɛ makada na epeko na bea mokuku mo wɛ pongono modi ta modidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Na bea, kɔɔ engɛlɛ na bohu bua bodi ta tei e wɛ bosakadipama na modidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ekada mokuku mo wɛ mosusu modi ta bohu, ko pɛ nongo ekenge emɔti edi ta modidi, mokuku mosusu mo wɛ modi ta bohu, elenge molinda akabwanedje mo mokuku na bohu bo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu apundi bapalusai na balehi ba mobeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Ehole esidjaka Yesu bobala, Mopalusai omɔti amohɔdjɔkɔ akayaka ta ndako e nde. Yesu akweaka ko adaka ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mopalusai akamoaka yana aenɛkɛ yo Yesu ayaka pɛ bososa mɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kumu abalaka na nde: «Endja, ino Bapalusai: okasoseni sokolu e kɔbɔ ko na sani, endolo ta tei olumini na posa i boiba ko milema mibe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Bato bataka e mawɛi! Yona okɔi sokolu akɔiti otei? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Pani adi batakeli ilodi ta kɔbɔ ko ta sani i bino, ko losusu ladake losɛnɔke tina e bino.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Ndjokwa na nu bapalusai! Okapɛni adi Ndjakomba ekenge emɔti na domi e ndjua elenge matungulu, pongono na mida misusu mi ndjua. Endolo okaboseni bodjo ko bopala Ndjakomba: edi midjɔ miboani na nu bokɔ, endolo napɛ bobosanani mia mikina.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Ndjokwa na nu, bapalusai! Okapaleni polo i gala ta sinagoga ko okapaleni bodima ndese i isuma ta polo i bhuda. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ndjokwa na nu! Odini elenge makila mataki embete ko bakamadalakake napɛ bodjeba!»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Okina molehi o mobeko abalaka na nde: «Molehi, yana abalaka wɛ bea, olosingi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Ndjokwa na nu pongono balehi ba mobeko! Okaloadjeni bato mina mi mandi mia mikadae no pɛ bobɛndjɛni nongo na sɔngɔ e mosapi! <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ndjokwa na nu! Okatongeni makila ma ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba, enakobea edi ba sangwanu bato ba bowa! <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Na tina emina wainedjakani misala mi ba sangwanu. Tengasa ibo baowa ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ko ino, watongakani makila ma bobo! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Na tina emina Ndjakomba na djebeli e nde, abalaka: “Nabalomeabi ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba na bapɔsɔlu: baowabi ekenge ekina ko bonɔngedja bakina.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Na tina emina, bato ba ehole ye baputabi lindo e makia ma ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba basusu donga ta mbangi e ngondo. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Donga makia ma Abɛlɛ mbunoko makia ma Djakalia, yona owabo ta polo ekatumbebo mbeka ko ta polo esɛnɔke. Soti, nabali na nu, bato ba ehole ye batombabi mandi ma makia ma ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba basusu ibowa bo!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Ndjokwa tina e bino balehi ba mobeko! Odongedjani pongola djebeli; ino bɛnɛ oikweani ko oipani ndjea adi bato ibapalaka bokwea.» <verse eid="LUK 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ehole eima Yesu ta ndako emina, balehi ba mobeko na bapalusai badaka na kɛlɛ na nde epipo badaka bamohɔdjɔ mahɔdjɔ tungu na tungu: <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />badaka bomomeka, bɛngi badie mo ekenge o kɔpi ebe ekaima ta monɔkɔ mo nde.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Bokebedja tina e mayɛlɛ mabe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10, 26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Oko ta ehole emina, koto na koto i bato baputoanaka ena, polo eboisa mako eidaka. Yesu abalaka boso na batingami ba nde: «Dani na edinga, na levile e bapalusai, badi ndjɔ o melo mibae. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Misusu mibolama mienɛmɛbi, misusu mi mbombi midjebamabi. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Na tina emina, misusu mabalake no ta modidi miokamabi ta moyi; ko misusu mibalabi no na popoli ta itoi, ta bikenge bi ndako bidipamake mibalamabi ta diko i ndako.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oboani na nu bobanga</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«Notɔndeini, baningani: Pɛ bobangani bia bakowoe mokuku, tine boo baboaniti bokɔ eka ekina. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Napalaka noinedjeni moto oboani na nu bobanga. Bangani yona, ngɔngɔ i bowa, adi na kpatsi e bodumbani ta mosa mo ipelu. Soti, nabali na nu, edi yo oboani na nu bobanga!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />«Te batɛke ba mbulu batano na palanga i bibende na motuya modi pɛ tina? Enakobea, Ndjakomba ta bose nongo mbulu omɔti. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Akadjebe nongo motuya mo swee i bino. Pɛ bobangani: onɔini mbulu bia na tina!»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodima kaoko boingana bo Yesu Kilito</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10, 32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12, 32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10, 19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Nabali na nu: moto obalabi ta boso bo bato: «Mbi nadi o Yesu;» ibea Mwana o Moto abalabi na nde pongono ta miso ma babwɛndji ba Ndjakomba: «Moto yona adi o mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Endolo moto akabala ta miso ma bato: «Mbi naditi o Yesu;» ibea Mwana o Moto abalabi na nde pongono ta miso ma babwɛndji ba Ndjakomba: «Moto yona aditi o mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Ko moto yona obalabi bobe ta tina e Mwana o Moto ayɛmɛbi; endolo yona osingabi Mwembo Mosɛnɔke ayɛmetebi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />«Ehole eotombabini bo ta ba sinagoga kaoko ta boso bo bakondji bɛngi bosambedjeni, pɛ bosatungeani na eka edi no bobala ta ehole edi no bosamba. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Tengasa Mwembo Mosɛnɔke aolehabini ta ehole yena eka eboani na nu bobala.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i modieli otaka e bowɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />A ndanda e bato, moto omɔti abalaka na Yesu: «Molehi, bala na mwange e mbi akabane bodieli bokina sange biso.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Omina ohɔini mosambedji koako mokati o midjɔ mi bodieli bo bino nda?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ko abalaka na bu basusu: «Kɔni engɛlɛ! Tengasa osaka dani na posa ebolumedja bodieli, mohelo mo moto moditi tine bodieli bodi na nde.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Abatɔndeaka isɛ imɔti: «Modieli omɔti adaka na gbie e nde emoboteaka mbuma djinɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Adaka alɛdjɛ ko bosahɔdjɔ: “Nakɔe bo? Naditi na polo e bobomba mbuma i mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka endja: “Eka eboani na mbi bokɔ: Nabukake ndako i boso, na tongake inɔi na bonɛnɛ, bɛngi naise mbuma i mbi ibule ko na madieli makina oho. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ngɔngɔ, asabaleaka yo mɛnɛ: O, mohelo mo mbi olumi na bodieli bonɛnɛ tine bianga binɛnɛ! Pɛ bosatungea naikina, yaka, mwaka ko sepa.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Endolo Ndjakomba abalaka na nde: “Moto otaka e bowɛi! Oko ta bulu bu wagwaka. Ko na bea, lolumedja wɛ lodikabi na nda?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Edi oko bea adi moto yona okabombe leka tine e nde yo mɛnɛ, endolo aditi modieli ta miso ma Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boisa molema adi Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6, 25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Endjani eka abalaka mbi na nu: pɛ bosatungeani ta mohelo mo bino, tine leka loboyaka. Pɛ bosatungeani na mikuku mi bino, tine bisendja bibolwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Tengasa mohelo monɔi mia na motuya, ko mokuku monɔi bisendja na motuya. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Endjani bingbondo: Tebaone gbie, tebabukake eka emɔti, editi na ndako e bobomba leka ko editi na ndako; endolo Ndjakomba akabayedje. Na bea ino onɔitini mbulu, na tina? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ndani ta tei e bino, aboani bokaedja masu ma nde ma mohelo, nabokɛsɛdji bodi na nde? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Omitidani na mwɛngi mo bokɔ moeka mokɛkɛ, tina nda odini bosatungeani na lokina? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Endjani moda mokatɔe pulɛlɛ: Te i salake, ko te djisatongeake bisendja. Endolo, notɔndeakani, nongo Salomo ta bokumu bo nde bosusu, ailwa nongo bisendja bipele bokokana na pulɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ekadabo Ndjakomba akaloadje ndjani idi busa bu ta gbie ko puma djadumbamake ta mosa: aboaniti bolwadja no? Bato ba bodima bokɛkɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Pɛ bosatungeakani: “Ayake so nde? Amwake so nde? Alwake so nde?” <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Edi bato bakadae pɛ bodjeba Ndjakomba bakasatungee na meako mimina mi ngondo bihole bisusu. Endolo ta tina e bino, Sange e bino akadjebe boo odini na lu na posa. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Hombani boso bokumu bo Ndjakomba ko losusu lodiki lopamabi na nu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodieli ta busa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Pɛ bobangani, engbanga e bhata ekɛkɛ! Tengasa Sange e bino asepi bopani Bokumu.<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Tɛkɛni leka lo bino ko pani palanga adi batakeli. Bombani leka lo bino ta ibenga ikadae pɛ bobeha, bombani bodieli bo bino ta busa, oho moibi ataimea ko sɛ batabedja. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Tengasa polo edi bodieli bo wɛ, adi molema mo wɛ oko ena.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basali bakadae basɛndjɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />«Salingoani ta mosala ko sangatanani boo milinda mi bino midae bihole bisusu mibwanake. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Dani elenge basali bia bambaka ihule i Kumu o bobo yona ahulake ta tɛkɛ e moki, na tina e bomodipoa ekukɛ ta ehole aimeake yo ko abomake yo ekukɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Sepi adi basali ta ihule i Kumu o bobo abataneake badi mosu! Nabali na nu, edi soti: alwabi bisendja bi mosala, abadedjabi ta mesa ko abapabi mia ma boyaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Ekadabo ahuli na bulu kaoko ta kɔkɔ o boso, akabatanea mosu, yana mɛnɛ adabi na basali na sepi!»<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />«Djebani bopele mɛnɛ: ekada boo Moswa ndako akadjeba ehole eboani moibi bo dua, atakinake boo akwe ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Ino pongono, sangatanani tengasa Mwana o Moto aduabi ta ehole edi no pɛ bolɛdjɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosali mopele ko mosali mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24, 45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Piɛlɛ abalaka: «Kumu, edi tine biso abalaka na wɛ isɛ i mina kaoko tine bato basusu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Kumu asɔmbedjaka: «Mosali okaisebo molema ko na bowɛi adi nda? Edi yona, kumu amopabi mosala mobosɛndjɛlɛ ndako ko bopa adi bakina basali ma bobo mia ta ehole eboani. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Sepi na mosali, yona ta ihule i Kumu o nde, amotaneake adi ta mosala! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ta Soti, nabali na nu, Kumu amopabi kpatsi ebobanea leka lo nde losusu. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Endolo ekada boo mosali mwali asabalei ta molema: “kumu o mbi atahulake edɛdi”; aimei bonɔngedja basali bamina bali, boyaka, bomwaka ko bolangoa; <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Bea kumu o nde ahulabi ta isu idi mosali pɛ bodjeba; amopabi etumbo epipo ko amoisabi ta molɔngɔ mo basali babe. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Mosali yona okadjebe midjɔ mikapale kumu o nde, endolo amiti mikɔ na bokokedja posa e kumu o nde akɛsɛmɛbi mbalake djinɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Tengasa, yona okadae pɛ bodjeba bokɔ midjɔ mikapale kumu ko akɔi meako miboani na nde bodiha etumbo; bamokɛsɛbi mbalake djikɛkɛ. Adi moto ndani odihi lonɛnɛ, bamosɛngɛbi lonɛnɛ: basɛngɛke adi moto boboana nalodihi yo.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adi ibaku</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Mbi nadua tine boisa mosa ta ngondo. Posa e mbi edi na moenɛ mabwana! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Natungi nadie inelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu apalaka abwanedje bogwa bo nde ibua baduake na inelo</char></note> imɔti ko molema mo mbi modi na mosa tine boo napakini ainama! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Olɛdjini nadua apa bogo ta ngondo? Ngasa, nabali na nu, nadoi agbɔtodja. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Tengasa, donga iya edɛdi batano ta ndako emɔti bagbɔtɔbi: basato bolona babae, ko babae bolona basato; <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Sange e moto agbɔtɔbi na mwana o nde ko mwana agbɔtɔbi na sange e nde; nange moto agbɔtɔbi na mwana o nde o mwali ko mwana mwali agbɔtɔbi na nange e nde; bokio bo mwali agbɔtɔbi na mwali o mwana o nde momi, mwali o mwana o nde momi agbɔtɔbi na bokio bo nde mwali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mik 7, 6.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodjeba ehole</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Abalaka naikina na emumu e bato: «Ehole enino itute iangɔi ta pamba ekasame modakabusa, okabaleni: “Mbua adoi akwa” ko ekakɔme oko bea. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ko ehole enino mopɛpɛ modongi ta satina, okabaleni: “Busa bu edjungu edake epipo”, ko ekakɔme oko bea. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Okadjebeni botikoanedjani bimbete bi ngondo ko na bi busa. Tina ndani otadjebakani bihole biedɛdi?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bookani na moloni o wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5, 25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Tina nda ino bɛnɛ totikoanedjeni midjɔ midi ta tei e bino na bodjo? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ehole edi wɛ na modjɔ na moto ko okɛini ta boso bo djudji, kɔɔ na ngulu boo okaneni ehole edi no na ndjea. Tengasa aotombake ta boso bo djudji, ko djudji akaopa ta mɔmɔ ma pulusu ko pulusu aisake ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nabali na wɛ: oimetebi ena oko opute nyongo e wɛ, mbunoko ta palanga esuka.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bagalilea banɔngɔmo na Pilato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ta ehole emina, bato bakɛkɛ baduaka adi Yesu. Bamotɔndeaka meako misusu mikɔkɔ Pilato moda mowaka yo Bagalilea ta ehole edaka bo batumbea Ndjakomba mbeka e makia. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu abasɔmbedja: «Walɛdjɛkɛni boo Bagalilea bamina banɔkɔ Bagalilea basusu na bobe, tine babowoe bea?» <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ngasa, nabali na nu. Endolo omiti hombedjani milema, wagwakeni no basusu oko elenge bo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />«Ko bato domi na bo mwambe bia bagwa ehole ebukea egbili e Silowe: walɛdjɛkɛni boo bato bamina banɔkɔ na bobe bato basusu ba Yelusalɛmɛ? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ngasa, nabali na nu: Endolo omiti hombedjani milema, wagwakeni elenge bo.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mole mo pigi mokadae pɛ bobota mbuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Na bea Yesu abalaka pongono isɛ di: «Moto omɔti aonaka mole mo pigi ta gbie e nde e vino. Akɛkɛ ahomba mbuma aidiaka. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Na bea abalaka na mosali: “Endja: enɔi mbula basato, nakadue ahomba mbuma ta mole mu, tenadiake. Mokwɛlɛ! Tine modjikikali oko ngasa.” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Endolo mosali amosɔmbedjaka: “Kumu, petemokina; nalongeake kpɔtɔ mbuti ko naisake kasa djipɔlu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ehole ekina mabotakedea mbuma ta mbula o ngɔngɔ; momitikobota, oboani bomokwɛlɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mwali o ongundama mokɔngɔ ta busa bo sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Busa bomɔti bo sabata, Yesu adaka aleha ta sinagoga. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mwali omɔti opekaka bianga domi na bo mwambe adaka ena. Mwembo mobe mo mobuka mokɔngɔ adaka mongundamake ko aidaka na mwɛngi mobosaninodja. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu mwali omina, amobeaka ko abalaka na nde: «Oheli na yogo e wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Amobakeaka mɔmɔ, mbala emɔti, asaninɔdji ko abangaka bokumedja Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Endolo mokondji o sinagoga, aoka kɛlɛ moda moheledja Yesu mwali omina ta busa bo sabata. Abalaka na emumu e bato: «Lodi na masu masamano ma mosala; dua ahombani mohelo ta masu mamina, te ta busa bo sabata!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Kumu amosɔmbedjaka: «Ndjɔ ba melo mibae! Ta busa bo sabata, pɛ nongo omɔti ta tei bino taimedje ngɔmbɛ kaoko ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ane edi tito okabɔke bo na bato tine botomba migumba, edi mokɛkɛ ko edi na matoi mayai bonɔ punda</char></note> o nde ta ikutu, bɛngi akɛ aeyakedja, kaoko aenusedja madiba? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ko mwali yo, adi o mbota e Abalayama; Satana amonanga bianga domi na bo mwambe, aboaniti bohela ta busa bu bo sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ehole ebalaka Yesu bea baloni ba nde baokaka sɔni. Endolo emumu e bato esusu basepaka na misala mibokamoa imikɔkɔ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mbuma e motade</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu abalaka: «Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bo boani na ye? Naboboanedje mɛnɛ na eka nda? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Eboani na mbuma e motade etomba moto ko eonaka ta gbie e nde: ekakandoe, ekaime mole monɛnɛ, ko mbulu idiko botonga mopo ta bitape bi mole momina.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i levile</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13, 33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu abalaka naikina: «Naboanedje Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na ye? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Boboani na bole bo levile ekatombe mwali abongoanedji na kɔbɔ isato i palini, ko mobɔtu momina mosusu mohaloi.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekukɛ ekɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7, 13-14</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu adaka akɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ akatisaka mabonga manɛnɛnɛ na makɛkɛkɛ ko alehaka. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Moto omɔti amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, Ndjakomba aheledjabi oko bato bakɛkɛ?» Yesu amosɔmbedja: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Kweani ta ekukɛ e embamba; tengasa nabali na nu, banɛnɛ bahombabi bokwea ko bakoketebi bokwea.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Ehole esangɔdjɔbi moswa ndako ko akangabi ekukɛ na pungola, odikabini sokolu, obomakabini ekukɛ ko obalakabini: “Kumu, lodipoa!”, Aosɔmbedjabini: “Natodjebakani!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Na bea, obalabini na nde: “loyaka ko lo mwaka na wɛ, olehaka ta ndjea i mabonga ma biso manɛnɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Aosɔmbedjabi naikina: “Natodjebakani. Dongani mbuti na mbi, Ino bato babe!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Oho edabi biyo na bokpɛkɛlɛ mino, ehole enɛbi no Abalayama, Isaka, Djakobo ko ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba basusu ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba; endolo ino odumbamabini sokolu! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Bato badongakabi ta dɔngɔ ikime moi na ikasame moi, ta sadiko na satina; tine boda polo emɔti ta mesa e Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Na bea, bato ba ngɔngɔ badakabi bato ba boso ko bato ba boso badakabi bato ba ngɔngɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei tine e Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23, 37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Oko ta ehole emina, bakina bapalusai ba batamaka mbuti na Yesu ko babalaka: «Donga ya, kɛ pamba ekina, tengasa Elode ahombaka aowoe.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu abasɔmbedja: «Kɛni atɔndea ebanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu abeaka Elode ebanga tengasa ta malɛno ma Bayuda, ebanga tito obowɛi bobe: olaka bobala boo Elode adi moto obowɛi bobe.</char></note> omina: “Nabenganaka miembo mibe ko naheledjaka bato busa bu mbunoko puma, ko ta isu i basato nasidjake mosala mo mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esika ye einedjaka bo Yesu abalaka na isɛ. Epalaka bobala bo na moehole mokɛkɛ aimeake ta Yelusalɛmɛ tina e bosidja mosala momoloma Ndjakomba.</char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Endolo etungi nakɛ oko busa bu, puma na puma sɛnɛ, tengasa eboaniti na mbaeli o Ndjakomba agwɛ sokolu e Yelusalɛmɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Yelusalɛmɛ, Yelusalɛmɛ, wɛ iyo okowoe ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ko okabowoe na mabanga bato bakolomee Ndjakomba! Mbala djeka ikahombe mbi bobongoanedja bana ba wɛ polo emɔti, elenge ekabongoanedje kɔkɔ bana ba bobo ta mangbangu ma bobo! Endolo wɛ oipalaka! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Endja ndako e wɛ edɛdi esundolamake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yil 22, 5.</char></note>! Nabali na nu: Oenɛtebinini mbunoko busa bobalabino: “Ndjakomba adjongoe yona aduake na kombe e Kumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 118.26</char></note>!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto ta busa bo sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Busa bomɔti bo sabata, Yesu akɛkɛ ayaka ta ndako e omɔti o bakondji ba bapalusai. Bato ibadaka ena baendjaka Yesu na bokokoledja mɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Enako bea edaka ta boso bo nde moto omɔti adaka na yogo e bogbaloa mokuku. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu ahɔdjɔkɔ balehi ba mobeko ko Bapalusai: «Eboani boheledja moto ta busa bo sabata kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Badikaka bogo. Na bea apeaka moto o epeko, amoheledja ko amoyanedjaka. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na bu: «Omɔti o bino, akada na mwana, kaoko ngɔmbɛ akwi ta mombɔndɔ, abosaniti bomoiwa pɛpɛlɛ, ta busa bo sabata?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Baidjebaka kɔpi ebomosɔmbedja.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eleho ebohomba polo e sangɔngɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu aenɛkɛ moda modaka bato ibabeamaka bahɔkɔ bisika bi boso. Abalaka na bu na isɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Ehole ebeami wɛ na moto ta tɛkɛ, pɛ bokɛ ada ta kiti e boso. Ehole ekina moto onɔi na gala abeama pongono; <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ibea moto obeaki na wɛ na nde abalake na wɛ: “Mokinea kiti ye.” Wangɔke na sɔni enɛnɛ bokada ta kiti e sangɔngɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Endolo, ekada boo obeami ta tɛkɛ, kɛ daa ta kiti e sangɔngɔ, tine ehole aduake moto obei, abalake na wɛ: “Maninga, dua adae ta kiti ye!” Na moda mua, adake tine e wɛ gala ta boso bo bato basusu badi na wɛ ta mesa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Edi oko bea, moto yona okasangɔdje bamotitedjabi, ko yona okasatitedje bamoangɔdjɔbi.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eleho e bobea batakeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Na bea Yesu abalaka pongono na moto yona omobeaka: «Ehole esalingoi wɛ mia ma tɛkɛ edae na midi, kaoko mɔmɔkɔ pɛ bobea: bangi wɛ, mela ma wɛ, bato badi na bodieli bonɛnɛ. Tengasa badi bobea e bobo mbala bɛngi bosɔmbedje imibakɔ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Endolo okasalingoa mia ma tɛkɛ, bea batakeli, bato ba biɛmɛ, bato bamitɛngu, bato ba miso mago. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Wadake moto o sepi tengasa ibo baditi na eka ebosɔmbedja. Endolo Ndjakomba aoputabi ta bopusoa bo bato ba bodjo.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i tɛkɛ enɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ngɔngɔ i boka meako mi, omɔti obabeami odaka na nde ta mesa abalaka na nde: «Sepi na yona oyakabi mia ma tɛkɛ ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Moto omɔti abɔngedja mia manɛnɛ ko abeaka bato banɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ta ehole e boyaka, alomaka mosali o nde akatɔndea bato babeaka yo: “Duani, leka losusu loboani.” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Endolo bo basusu, omɔti na omɔti, abangaka bohɔdjɔ enɔeli. Oboso atɔndeaka mosali: “Nahulake asomba gbie, etungi nakɛ aendja; nongɔni boo oyɛni”. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Okina amotɔndeaka: “Nahulake asomba ngɔmbɛ domi, eboani nakɛi abameka; nongɔni boo oyɛni!” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Okina amotɔndeaka: “Nahulake asɔ mwali: na tina emina nataduake!” <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Mosali, ahulaka, atɔndeaka kumu misɔmbedja mimina. Na bea kumu o ndako, alumaka na kɛlɛ, abali na mosali o nde: “Kɛ pɛpɛlɛ ta bisaka bi bhuda, ko ta ndjea inɛnɛnɛ, na i mabonga manɛnɛnɛ, beani batakeli, bato bamitɛngu, bato bagwa miso na bitumbe.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ngɔngɔ i moehole mosali abalaka: “kumu nakɔi misusu milomakini wɛ, ko polo djidi oko!” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Kumu abalaka na mosali: “Kɛɛ ta ndjea i mabonga manɛnɛnɛ ko ta ndjea i gbie, pangoani bato bakwe, ebɛngi polo ilume. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nabali na wɛ, pɛ nongo moto omɔti obeaki mbi boso atayake mia ma mbi.”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meako mi tina bɛngi oime motingami</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10, 37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Emumu e bato badalaka na Yesu na ndjea. Na bea ahombanaka ko abalaka na bu: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Moto wapalaka akimaneni atungi adae pɛ bolona sange e nde, nange e nde, bana ba nde, bange i nde, bangɛnɛ i nde, ko edae mohelo mo nde yo mɛnɛ. Pɛ bea aboaniti boda motingami o mbi. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Yona adake pɛ botomba ekulusu e nde, bɛngi akimaneni aboaniti boimea motingami o mbi. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Na bea, ta ndanda e bino, moto akapala atonge egbili, aboani boso boda tine bolɛdja, boendja palanga idi na nde kaoko iboani bosidja mosala momina. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ekadabo alongei pondasio ko amiti koka bosidja botonga egbili emina bato basusu bamoenɛkɛ abangake bomosɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Babangaka bobala na nde: “moto iyo abangaki botonga egbili igbɔ imoli.” <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Oko moda momɔti, ekada na mokondji omɔti yona, apalaka akɛ ana bila na mokondji okina, adake boso tine bosahɔdjɔ kaoko aboani bohɔnɔ, na bami koto domi, boana na moloni yona odi boso bo nde na bami koto ibae? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Akaenɛ boo aboaniti bohɔnɔ, alomake bato adi mokondji yona, ehole edi yo bohali tine bohomba bogo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Oko moda momina, Pɛ moto omɔti ta ndanda e bino aboaniti boimea motingami o mbi, amiti lona leka lo nde losusu. <verse eid="LUK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Bokpa bo monana modi eka epele; endolo mokataka ngɛngɛ, tina e mu nda? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Moditi na tina ta kpɔtɔ, nongo ta bipɔlu; bamodumbabi sokolu. Moto odi na matoi ma boka, aoke!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ li bhata ebunga ko ebolwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18, 12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Baputedji ba puti na bato babe babatamaka mbuti na Yesu tine bomohokamedja. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Bapalusai ko balehi ba mobeko bahimahimaka na nde: «Ndenge nda? Moto iyo asɔkɔ bato ba mabe ko ayaka na bu polo emɔti!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu isɛ di: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Ekadabo moto omɔti atei e bino, akada na bhata mokama ko bhata omɔti akabunga, aboaniti bokina bhata tuku ibua na ibua ta etengelenge tine bohomba bhata yona obungi? Mbunoko amobolodje? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Akaebolodja, aebakeake ta malokuloku ma nde, na sepi. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Ko, ta ihule i nde, abeake ba binande na bato badi mbuti na nde, tine bobatɔndea: “Sepani na mbi engbanga, tengasa nabolodji bhata o mbi obungaki!” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Oko moda momɔti, nabalaka na nu, sepi edabi ta busa tine moto omɔti o bobe akahombedja molema mo nde: sepi emina enɔi sepi e bato ba bodjo tuku ibua na ibua bia baditi na tina e bohombedja milema mi bobo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pata e palanga e bunga ko e boloa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Ekadabo mwali omɔti, adi na pata e palanga e nde emɔti ko aebungedji; atabwanedjake molinda, akɛkɛ aombɔkɔke ndako ko naboehombahomba, mbunoko aebolodje? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ko akaebolodja, abeake binande bali badi mbuti na nde, ko abatɔndeake: “Sepani na mbi pongono, tengasa nabolodji pata e palanga yena ebungaka na mbi!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Mondumba mabalaka mbi na nu: Sepi edi ta boso bo babwɛndji ba Ndjakomba ta modjɔ mo moto o bobe omɔti yona ohombedji molema mo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana momi obungaka ko aboloi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu abalaka naikina: «Okina moto adaka na bana bami ba bae. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yona o yɛngɛ abalaka na sange e nde: “Sange mbi, pani i mbi ibondo i bodieli iboani na mbi bosangoa.” Ibea sange bobo akabanaka leka londe na bana ba nde babae. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ngɔngɔ i masu bonɔ, mwana o yɛngɛ atɛkɛ ko atomba palanga imina, akɛ ahelama ta ikina ibonga bohali mɛnɛ. Oho abedjaka bodieli bo nde bosusu na mohelo mowusuwusu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Amayosidja bodieli bo nde bosusu, ndja enɛnɛ ekweaka ta ibonga imina, ko aimeaka na botaka. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Akweaka mosala adi moto omɔti o ibonga imina, ko amolomaka ta gbie e nde tine boyakedja ngulu ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Adaka na posa ebosidja ndja e nde na mbuma i kalubi iyaka ngulu, endolo moto aimopaka. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ta tei e nde asabaleaka: “Basali basusu ba sange mbi bayaka mia moda mopali bo, e ndolo mbi iya nagwaka mɛnɛ na ndja! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nadoi ayana adi sange e mbi ko nabalake na nde: Sange e mbi, nakɔɔ bobe ta boso bo Ndjakomba ko ta boso bo wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Naboaniti nongo nabeame mwana o wɛ; endolo tombani elenge mosali o wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Angɔkɔ ayanaka adi sange nde. Iyana adakayo bohali, sange e nde amoenɛkɛ ko aoka ndjokwa enɛnɛ; apotaka ko amobhimbaka.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana abalaka na nde: “Sange mbi, nakɔ bobe ta boso bo Ndjakomba na ta boso bo wɛ, naboaniti nongo nabeame mwana o wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Endolo sange e nde abalaka na basali ba nde: “Duani pɛpɛlɛ na mokoto monɔi na bopele ko molwadjani! Mopɛtɛ ta mosapi ko molwadjani sapato! <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Duani na mwana o ngɔmbɛ omuta, ko mowani, loyake ko lokɔe tɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Tengasa mwana o mbi adaki mogo, ko asɔmbi ta mohelo; abungaka, ko aboloi!” Ko babangaka tɛkɛ.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Ta ehole emina, mwana o nde o sɔmi adaka ta gbie. Ta ihule i nde, ehole ebatama yo mbuti na ndako, aokaka kilingo i ngɔmbi na ngɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Abeaka mosali omɔti bomohɔdjɔ mia midjɔ manɔkɔ oho nda? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Mosali amosɔmbedjaka: “Mwange wɛ ahuli! Sange wɛ amowoi mwana o ngɔmbɛ o muta aimei adi na mohelo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Endolo alumaka na kɛlɛ; ko alonaka bokwea ta ndako, Sange nde aimaka amongɔnɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Endolo asɔmbedjaka sange e nde: “Mbi nakɔi bianga binɛnɛ bisala mbi adi wɛ nailonaka nongo elomu e wɛ emɔti. Oiyoweani nongo mwana o kambeli tine nakɔe tɛkɛ na bina mbi! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Endolo ta tina e mwana o wɛ yona, obedja bodieli bo wɛ na wusuwusu na ndukeli, ehole ehuli yo wɛ omowei mwana o ngɔmbɛ o muta!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Sange nde amosɔmbedjaka: “Wɛ mwana o mbi, odi na mbi bihole bisusu iya, ko losusu lodi na mbi lodi lo wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Endolo eboani lokɔe tɛkɛ ko losepe, tine ngɔnge wɛ yo ogwaka, ko adi ta mohelo; abungaki, ko aboloi!”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mobanei o kaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Abalaka pongono na batingami: «Modieli omɔti adaka na mobanei o leka lo nde. Bato bamopundaka adi mokondji boo: abedjaka leka lo wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Amobeaka ko abalaka na nde: “Eka eokaka mbi na kombe e wɛ nda? Tombeani sɔngi e mosala mopa mbi, tine oboaniti boda na ikina mobanei o leka lo mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mobanei asabaleaka: “Nakɔe bo, kumu o mbi adongedjini mɛnɛ ta mosala mo bobanea leka? Enakobea naditi na ngulu ebolia gbie, nokake sɔni tine bosɛngɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Nadjebi eka eboani mbi bokɔ, tine bato basɔeni Adibo ta ehole adongedjakeni mokondji o mbi ta mosala.” <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Okobea abeaka moto omɔti na omɔti a ndanda e bato badaka na nyongo e kumu. Abalaka na o boso: “nyongo e kumu edi motuya nda?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Amosɔmbedjaka: Mimbonda mi munɛ mokama. Mobanei amotɔndeaka: “Tomba mokanda mo wɛ mo nyongo, daa ya ko koma pɛpɛlɛ tuku itano i mimbonda mi munɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Abalaka na okina: “ko wɛ, nyongo e mokondji edi motuya nda?” Amosɔmbedjaka: “Sɛki i lɔsɔ mokama”. Mobanei amotɔndeaka: “Tomba mokanda mo wɛ mo nyongo, daa ya koma pɛpɛlɛ tuku bo mwambe”. <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Ibea, mokondji asakoaka mobanei o kaso tine bowɛi bo nde. Tengasa bato ba ngondo ye badi na bowɛi bonɔ bana ba bohu.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Endja: «Mbi nabalaka na nu: Imeani bange i badieli bataka ebodjɔ, tengasa ehole edabi bo pɛ boda, basɔbini ta ndako e seko. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Yona okaise molema ta baamidjɔ bakɛkɛ, akaise molema pongono ta midjɔ minɛnɛ. Yona odi na boloa ta baamidjɔ bakɛkɛ adi pongono na boloa ta midjɔ minɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ekada boo oidaka na bodjo ta mondumba mo bosala bodieli bo bolowa bo ngondo ye, moto oboani aopɛni bodieli bopele nda? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Enakobea omiti enɛmɛni bodjo ta bobanea leka lo bato bakina, odi bopani leka lo bino bɛnɛ nda?» <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />«Mosali omɔti aboaniti bosalea bakumu babae. Tengasa, aboani bolona omɔti ko bopala okina, kaoko bosapa na omɔti ko bolona okina. Oboaniti boda mbala emɔti mosali o Ndjakomba ko na palanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 6, 24</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bileho bikina bi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10, 11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Bapalusai, ibadaka na ekpaka e palanga bonɔ badaka baoka meako mimina misusu bataaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Ino okasainedjeni bodjo ta miso ma bato, endolo Ndjakomba akadjebe milema mi bino. Tengasa eka ekalɛdje bato boo edi enɛnɛ, ekapɛ Ndjakomba kɛlɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Ehole e mobeko mo Mose ko na buku i ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba eyeyoa mbunoko ehole e Yoane Mobatisi. Donga ta ehole emina, Bwɛndi Bopele bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodi bolehama ko bato basusu baboani boana na ngulu boo bakwe oho. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Busa na kpɔtɔ boboani bodimoa pɛpɛlɛ, endolo edi na bopipo boo nongo mo itɔnɔ o mobeko akwɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Momi mosusu odongedji mwali o nde ta moki ko asɔi okina akɔi bɔɔli, ko yona oasɔi mwali odongedji bo ta moki akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Modieli ko Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />«Edaka na moto omɔti modieli, iyona odaka alwa bisendja bipele ko bi motuya monɛnɛ. Masu masusu ahelamaka bopele ko adaka ayaka elenge moto akɔkɔ tɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ta boso bo ekukɛ e ndako e modiele motakeli omɔti asasambeaka ena. Kombe e nde Ladjalo, ko mokuku mo nde moluma na pola. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Adaka na posa e bosindja ndja e nde nongo na mbumbu ikwaka ta mesa e modieli; Ta polo emina, mbwa aduaka aomboa pola i nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Motakeli agwaka ko babwɛndji bamotombaka bamodedjaka mbuti na Abalayama. Modieli pongono agwaka ko bamopuseaka. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Adaka anɔngɔ mɛnɛ ta polo e ngando i bago. Ta ehole eangɔdjɔkɔ yo miso aenɛkɛ bohali Ladjalo adi mbuti na Abalayama. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Na bea alɛbɛkɛ: “Sange mbi Abalayama, okeani ndjokwa! Loma Ladjalo adube sɔngɔ e mosapi mo nde ta madiba tine botitimedjani molema, tengasa naenɛkɛ saya enɛnɛ iya ta mosa mu.” <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Endolo Abalayama amosɔmbedjaka: “Mwamba, lɛdjɛ odiaka bodieli bonɛnɛ ta mohelo mo wɛ mosusu, enakobea Ladjalo adaka aenɛ saya enɛnɛ. Edɛdi, mohelo mo nde modi ta iheme, ko wɛ wenɛkɛ saya. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ko naikina, mombɔndɔ monɛnɛ modi ta pakaso e biso na nu. Mwɛngi moditi bato bodonga oho adi no bokatisa djɔno adi so, kaoko bodonga adi so bokatisa oho adi no.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Modieli abalaka: “Nongɔni Sange mba, loma nongo Ladjalo ta ndako e sange mbi, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />oho nadi na bangi mbi batano. Akɛ abatɔndea, basaka dua pongono ta polo ye e saya.” <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abalayama asɔmbedjaka: “Bangi wɛ badi na Mose na ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba tine bobatɔndea boo baboke!” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Modieli abalaka: “Ngasa etabɔngɔ, sange mbi Abalayama. Endolo moto ogwa akakɛ oho Adibo, bahombedjake milema mi bobo.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Endolo Abalayama amosɔmbedjaka: “Bamiti oka Mose na ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba, badimetebi nongo bapangoame na moto akapusoa adi bago.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Moda mo boda na bato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18, 6-7</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk 9, 42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Midjɔ mikataedje bato mabaku midakabi. Endolo ndjokwa adi moto yona, mabaku mamina maduake na ndjea e nde! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Enɔi bopele boo batinge moto omina ibanga igbɔgbɔ ta dɔli ko bomodumbe ta dua enɛnɛ, ta polo boo ataedje ibaku adi omɔti ta tei e bana bakɛkɛkɛ ibi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Sangatanani! Eka daa mwange wɛ aokɔi bobe mogamea. Ko akadima bobe bo nde moyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ekada mwange wɛ aokɔi bobe busa bomɔti mbala sambo ko asɔmbi adi wɛ mbala sambo na bobala: nadjebi bobe bo mbi, moyɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Bapɔsɔlu babalaka na Kumu: «Lobakea bodima bo biso». <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Kumu abasɔmbedjaka: «Osodani na bodima nongo bokɛkɛ elenge mbuma e motade, oboanini bobala na mole mu mo sikɔmɔlɔ: “Sabikoa ko kɛ asadumbe ta dua enɛnɛ”, ko mosumabini.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misala miboani na mosali bokɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Ekada omɔti o bino adi na mosali, yona okamone gbie; kaoko akabane bingbɛndɛ bi nde; abalake na nde soti akamoenɛ ahule ta gbie: “Dua pɛpɛlɛ ayake ta mesa?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ngasa, abalake na nde: “Kaleani mia, lwa bisendja bipele, ko dua pɛni mia. Ehole asidjake mbi boyaka ko na bomwaka; abalake na nde: Kɛ ayake ko amwake e wɛ engbanga pongono.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Aboani mɛnɛ bopa mɛlɛsi adi mosali ngɔngɔ i bokokedja meako misusu mibali wɛ na nde? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Edi oko bea tine bino, ekada boo okɔeni misusu imi miopini bo okɔeni: “Iso lodi oko basali, lokɔi mosala moboanaki na su bokɔ.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba mabha domi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu yana adakayo akɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ, anɔkɔ ta mwei mo Samalia na Galilea. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ehole ekweaka yo ta ibonga, bato ba mabha domi baduaka asakana na nde. Baemaka bohali, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ko babangaka bogama: «Yesu, Molehi, lokea ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ehole ebaenɛkɛ Yesu abalaka na bu: «Kɛni asainedjeni adi banganga ba Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 14, 2-32.</char></note>.» Ehole edaka bo bakɛ, basɛnoaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Omɔti o bobo, aenɛkɛ yo boo asɛnɔi, asɔmbɔkɔ akumedja Ndjakomba na moholi mopipo. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Asadumbaka ta mako ma Yesu boso ta kpɔtɔ, ko amopaka mɛlɛsi. Enakobea adakamo Samalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu ahɔdjɔkɔ: «Osɛnɔitini bato domi? Ko ibwa ba do? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Oko mokɛndɛli iyo asɔmbi apa Ndjakomba mɛlɛsi?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Bea Yesu abalaka na nde: «Angɔ, ko kɛɛ; bodima bo wɛ boheledji.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodua bo bokumu bo Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:23-41">Mat 24, 23-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Bapalusai bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu ehole ndani eboani Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodua Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boduetebi elenge eka ekenɛmɛ na miso. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Babaletebi: «Endjani adi yo iya!» Kaoko: «Endjani adi yo oho! Tengasa, Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodi a ndanda e bino.» <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Bea abalaka na batingami: «Masu maduake, wadakeni na posa e boenɛ Mwana o Moto, nongo isu i mɔti, endolo otamoenɛbini.»<verse eid="LUK 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masu ma mwana o moto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:26-27">Mat 24, 26-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:21-22">Mlk 13, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Babalabi na nu: «Endjani, adi iya!» Kaoko «Endjani, adi i bo! Endolo pɛ bokɛni, pɛ bopotani ebango tine bokɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Mondumba mokaimane mokalikali bobwanedja busa dɔngɔ na dɔngɔ, edabi oko bea bodua bo Mwana o Moto ta busa bo nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Endolo eboani boso mɛnɛ aenɛ saya enɛnɛ ko bato ba ehole ye bamolone. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Imikɔmɔkɔ ta ehole e Nowa mikɔmɔbi pongono ta isu i Mwana o Moto. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bato bayaka, bamwaka, bamina bali bosɔnɔkɔ, mbunoko busa bo Nowa bokwea yo ta masua. Ngɔngɔ pela eduaka ko eowaka bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Edaka pongono bea ta masu ma Lɔtɔ. Bato badaka bayaka, bamwaka, basombaka, batɛkɛkɛ, baonaka, ko batongaka. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Endolo isu ima Lɔtɔ ta Sɔdɔmo, mbua o mabanga ma mosa mokwaka donga ta busa mangodjaka bato ko bagwaka basusu. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Edabi oko moda momina ta isu isenɛmɛdjabi Mwana o Moto. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Ta isu imina, moto yona odabi ta mbalasani e ndako odiko atitetebi bɛngi adue atomba leka lo nde lodi ta otei e ndako! Oko bea, yona odabi ta gbie atasɔmbɔbi ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Lɛdjɛni mwali o Lɔtɔ! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Yona ohombabi boheledja mohelo mo nde, amobungedjabi; endolo yona obungedjabi mohelo mo nde, amodiabi.<verse eid="LUK 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nabali na nu, ta bulu bua, bato babae badabi ta bokaki bomɔti: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Bali babae badabi bainda mbuma polo emɔti, omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi. [<verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Bato babae bia basalaka mosala ta gbie emɔti: omɔti atombamabi ko okina adikabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ekenge ye editi mɛnɛ ta mikanda miyou (Endja pongono ta Mat 24, 40)</char></note>.]» <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Batingami bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, akɔmɔbi modjɔ momina djɔ?» Kumu abasɔmbedjaka: «Polo esusu esambi ebembe, bingbondo ikaputoane ena.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mwali ogwa na momi ko na djudji mobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde isɛ imɔti, tine bobainedja etungi seko bongɔnɔ napɛ, bokina: <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />«Edaka ta ibonga inɛnɛ djudji omɔti odaka pɛ bobanga Ndjakomba ko taendje mbanda e moto. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Edaka pongono ta ibonga imina, mwali omɔti ogwa na momi aduaka seko seko bobala na nde: “Kateani ikambo i mbi na moloni o mbi!” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Donga ehele, djudji aipalaka. Ngɔngɔ asabaleaka: “Nongo te na bange Ndjakomba ko tenedje mbanda e moto; <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />Endolo elenge mwali yo obogwa atungeakani mɛnɛ, nakataka ikambo i nde, tine atadedjakani bogo.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ibea Kumu abakeaka: «Okani eka abalaka djudji yona mobe! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ko Ndjakomba, akatetebi na bodjo midjɔ mi bato bia bahɔmɔ bakamongɔne bulu na moi? Ayeyoabi tina ebobakɔmedja? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nabali na nu: akatabi midjɔ mi bobo pɛpɛlɛ. Endolo ehole eduabi Mwana o Moto, ataneabi bodima ta ngondo?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i Mopalusai na Moputedji o puti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu abalaka isɛ di tina e bato bakasenɛ badi bodjo ta miso ma Ndjakomba ko botsiola bakina: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Bato babae bakɛkɛ ta tepelo tine bongɔnɔ; omɔti adaka Mopalusai okina adaka moputedji o puti. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mopalusai, aemaka diko, aongɔnɔkɔ ta tei e molema mo nde: “Oo Ndjakomba, naopi mɛlɛsi naditi elenge bato bakina, ibi badi baubi, milema mibeko bandukeli; kaoko elenge moputedji o puti iyo. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nakakie mbala ibae ta pɔsɔ, nakapɛ ekenge emɔti na domi e bodieli bo mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Endolo Moputedji o puti asemeaka bohali, aibɔngɔkɔ boendja miso ma nde ta busa ko asapeka ta molo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta polo ekomi so boo asapeaka ta molo edi adaka aboma bupa. Enakobea, tina e bayuda embete e boboma bupa edi embete e ndjokwa. Ta tina e biso edi embete e molumba.</char></note> eni asabalea: “Oo Ndjakomba, okeani ndjokwa, nadi moto mobe.” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Na bea nabali na nu soti, Ndjakomba alanga moputedji o puti iyo bodjo endolo te Mopalusai. Tengasa, moto yona okasangɔdje, bamotitedjabi, endolo yona okasatitedje, bamoangɔdjɔbi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bato baduaka na bana bakɛkɛ adi Yesu ababake mɔmɔ. Aenɛkɛ batingami bea, babasiaka. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Endolo Yesu abeaka bana ko abalaka: «Kinani bana badue adi mbi! Pɛ bobasiani, tengasa Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodi adi bia badi elenge bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nabali na nu, edi soti: moto odi pɛ boasɔ bokumu bo Ndjakomba elenge mwana akwetebi oho.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko modieli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk 10, 17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mokondji omɔti o Bayuda ahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Molehi mopele, eboani mbi bokɔ nde bɛngi nadie bomɔ bo seko?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Tina nda obeini molehi mopele? Moto mopele aditi dongedja oko Ndjakomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Odjebi mibeko: “Pɛ bokɔ ekobo; pɛ bowa moto; pɛ boiba; pɛ bobala tati e boloa tine moto; suma sange e wɛ na nange e wɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Moto omina asɔmbedjaka: «Nakasume mibeko misusu donga ta bobwɛngɛ bo mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ngɔngɔ i boka bea, Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Otaki modjɔ momɔti: tɛkɛ leka losusu lodi na wɛ ko kabana palanga na batakeli na bea wadiake madieli ta busa. Ngɔngɔ dua ko kimanani.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Endolo ehole eoka moto omina bea, asokea ndjokwa, tine adaka na bodieli bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yana amoenɛkɛ Yesu aimeaka na ndjokwa, abalaka: «Edi bopipo tina e bato ba bodieli bakwe ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Editi na bopipo boo kamela akwe ta ipose i tonga, endolo edi na bopipo mɛnɛ modieli akwe ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bato badaka bamohokamedja, babalaka: «Endolo ohelabi nda?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Modjɔ modi bato pɛ bohɔnɔ bokɔ, Ndjakomba adi bomokɔ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Piɛlɛ abalaka: «Oka, iso lokina leka lo biso losusu tine bokimana.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Notɔndeakani, edi soti: ekada moto okini, tine Bokumu bo Ndjakomba, ndako e nde, mwali o nde, ba ngɔngɔ i nde, baboti ba nde, bana ba nde, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />adiabi lonɛnɛ bonɔ ta ehole ye ko ta ngondo yena aduake; adiabi bomɔ bo seko.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi mbala e basato bogwa na bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk 10, 32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu abeaka batingami domi na babae ko abalaka na bu: «Okani, lokɛ ta ibonga Yelusalɛmɛ oho polo ekokedjamabi meako misusu mikoma ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba tina e Mwana o Moto. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Bamokababi ta mɔmɔ ma bapangano, bamosɛkɛbi, bamosingabi, ko bamotsweabi masɔi. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bamokɛsɛkɛbi na mbalake, ba mowabi ko ta isu i basato apusoabi ta bogwa.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Endolo batingami baisipoaka tina e meako mimina, tengasa midaka mbombi ta miso ma bobo. Baidjebaka eka epalaka Yesu bobala.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto ogwa miso</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10, 46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yana adaka Yesu bobatama na Yeliko, edaka na moto o miso mago adaka na mobondo ta yɔngɔ e ndjea tine bosengɛ ekamweli. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Aokaka daka emumu e bato badaka banɔe ko ahɔdjɔkɔ: Iye daka eokaka mbi eye? <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bamotɔndeaka: «Edi Yesu o Nasaleta yona anɔke.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Mbala emɔti agamaka: «Yesu, Mwana o Dapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ibiya ibadalaka boso bamogameaka apɔpɔne. Endolo yo agamaka naikina na ngulu: «Mwana o Dapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu aemaka ko abalaka: «Duani na nde.» Ehole ebatamaka yo na, Yesu amohɔdjɔkɔ: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Opali nakɔe na wɛ bo?» Asɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, kɔɔ boo naenɛ naikina.» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Oko bea, enɛ, bodima bo wɛ boheledji.» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Na mbala emɔti, aimeaka boenɛ, atingamaka ngɔngɔ i Yesu ko eni akumedja Ndjakomba. Emumu e bato aenɛbo bea ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba pongono.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu abeami adi Djakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Ngɔngɔ i bokwea ta Yeliko Yesu akatisaka ibonga imina. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Edaka oho moto omɔti kombe Djakayo; adaka mokondji o ba putedji ba puti ko adaka modieli. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Adaka na posa e boenɛ Yesu. Endolo elenge adakayo mokuwe, aibɔngɔkɔ bomoenɛ, tine emumu e bato. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Apotaka boso ko aiweaka ta mole mo sikomɔle, bɛngi aenɛ Yesu ehole anɔke yo ena. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ehole eimeaka Yesu ta polo emina, angɔdjɔkɔ miso ko abalaka na Djakayo: «Tita pɛpɛlɛ, Djakayo, tengasa etungi busa bu nadae ta ndako e wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Djakayo atitaka pɛpɛlɛ ko amoasɔkɔ na mongandi ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Aenɛkɛbo bea, bato basusu banungunaka ta tina e Yesu, babalaka: «Moto iyo akɛi ada ta ndako e moto mobe!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Djakayo, angɔkɔ ta boso bo Kumu, abalaka na nde: «Kumu, napake ndanda e bodieli bo mbi adi batakeli; ko nakakatoa moto palanga, namosɔmbedjake mbala inɛi.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu abalaka ta tina e nde: «Busa bu, mohelo mokwei ta ndako ye, tengasa yo pongono adi omɔti o ibota i Abalayama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Mwana o moto aduaka tine bohomba ko boheledja ibia babungaka.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i ebende e wolo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25, 14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yesu abalaka naikina isɛ tine bato baduaka aoka mibalo mi nde. Adaka mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ ko balɛdjɛkɛ boo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba boimeaka mbuti na bosaenɛmedja. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Endja moda mobalaka yo: «Moto omɔti o ibota i gala akɛkɛ ta ngondo e bohali bɛngi bamoimedje kumu; ko ahule ta ngondo e nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Boso bo bokɛ, abeaka basali ba nde domi, apaka adi omɔti na omɔti ebende e wolo e motuya monɛnɛ ko abalaka na bu: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Palanga e motuya monɛnɛ. Mandi mayu mabwani na iputi li masu mokama ma mosala mo mosali.</char></note> “Kɔni mombongu na palanga emina mbunoko ihule i mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Endolo bato ba ibonga e nde baimopalaka. Balomaka bato ngɔngɔ i nde bɛngi bamotɔnde boo: “Iso loloni wɛ boda kumu o biso.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Nongo bea bamoimedjaka kumu ko ahulaka ta ibonga i nde. Abeaka basali ba nde ibia bapaka yo palanga, bɛngi adjebe mbuka adiaka bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mosali o boso aimeaka ko abalaka: “kumu, nabakeaka bibende bi wolo domi ta djia djipakani wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Kumu abalaka na nde: “Edi bopele, odi mosali mopele. Tengasa odaki na bodjo ta midjɔ mikɛkɛkɛ, noimedji gupɛnɛlɛ o mabonga domi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Mosali o babae aduaka ko abalaka: “Kumu, na bakeaka bibende bi wolo bitano ta djia djipakani wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Kumu abalaka na yona: “wɛ, noimedji gupɛnɛlɛ o mabonga matano.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Okina mosali aduaka ko abalaka: “Kumu, endja ebende e wɛ e wolo iye. Naebomba ta epasa e esendja.” <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nadaka na bɔɔ na wɛ, tengasa okadɛ moto omongangale: okatombe eka eda wɛ pɛ bosambea, okabuke ta polo eda wɛ pɛ bona. <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kumu abalaka na nde: “Mosali mobe, nosambedjaka na bokimana na mibalo mi wɛ mɛnɛ. Odjebaka boo, nadi moto omongangale, nakatombe leka lokadae mbi pɛ bobomba, nakabuke leka lokadae mbi pɛ bona. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Na bea, tina ndani oibomba palanga e mbi ta ndako ekabombe bo palanga ekabee bo bange?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndako ekabombe bo palanga iya edi botingodja ndako iye ekabombe bo palanga?</char></note> Ta ihule i mbi, naboanaka boedia na mbuka.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na bia badaka ena: “Mokatoani ebende e wolo emina ko epani adi yona odi nadju domi.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Babalaka na nde: “kumu, adi nadju ehele domi!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />“Amosɔmbedjaka: Nabali na nu soti, moto yona odi na eka bamopabi naikina bonɔ; endolo adi yona odi ngasa, bamokatoabi eka edi na nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ta tina e baloni ba mbi ibalonaka nadae kumu, duani na bu iya ko baowani ta miso ma mbi.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akwei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ngɔngɔ isidjaka Yesu bobala bea, adalaka boso ta ndjea ekɛkɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ehole ebatamaka yo ta ibonga i Betepasa ko na Betania, mbuti na ngomba e Olipa, alomaka batingami babae boso. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Abalaka na bu «kɛni ta ibonga dia idi boso bo bino. Ehole aimeakeno, wataneakeni mwana o ane atingi, yona oda moto pɛ bobakama. Motingoani ko duani na nde iya. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ko moto akohɔdjɔni: “Tina ndani wa motingoakani?,” Balani na nde: “Kumu adi na posa na yu.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ibalomamaka bakɛkɛ ko bataneaka oko elenge ebalaka Yesu na bu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ta ehole etingoaka bo mwana o ane, baswa nde babalaka na bu: «Waetingoakani tina nda?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Basɔmbedjaka: «Kumu adi na posa na yu.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ko bahulaka na yu adi Yesu; babakeaka bisendja bi bobo diko i ane ko babakeaka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yana adakabo badale, bato bandaka bisendja bi bobo na ndjea. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Abatamaka yo mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ, ta ndjea enɔkɔ ta ngomba e Olipa, emumu e batingami, balumaka na mongandi, bakumedjaka Ndjakomba na moholi mopipo tine bimbete bi ngindola bienɛkɛ bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Babalaka: «Kina boo Ndjakomba yona odi diko i losusu adjongoe, yona aduake na kombe e Mokondji! Bogo ta busa ko ekumu adi Ndjakomba ta bisika binɔi odiko!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Bakina bapalusai, ibadaka ta emumu, babalaka na Yesu: «Molehi, tɔndea batingami ba wɛ bakine daka!» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Nabali na nu, nakabasia bakine daka, mabanga magamabi!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayei tine Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ehole ebatamaka Yesu na ibonga inɛnɛ ko aenɛkɛ yo, ayeaka tine eyu. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Abalaka: «Eso eda boo wɛ pongono odjebaka ta isu di, iyena eolwɛke bogo! Ndjokwa! Edɛdi modjɔ momina modi mobombamake ta miso ma wɛ! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Tengasa masu maduake baloni ba wɛ baohikabini na bianeli bipipo, baodeabini ko baombambamedjabini pamba djisusu. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Baobedjabini mɛnɛ, wɛ na bato ba wɛ! Bakinetebini ibanga imɔti ibaki diko i ikina! Tine boo oisipoani ehole aduaka Ndjakomba aokamoani!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abengani batɛki ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11, 15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu akweaka ta tepelo ko aimeaka bobengana batɛki. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Abalaka na bu: «Makomi mabalaka: “Ndako e mbi edabi ndako e miongɔnɔ.” Endolo ino, oimedjini ndako e baubi!»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yesu adaka aleha masu masusu ta bopango bo tepelo. Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, balehi ba mobeko, na bakumu ba bato, bahombaka enɔeli e bomowa. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Endolo baidjebaka mondumba mo bokɔ, tengasa bato basusu badaka bamohokamedja na edinga.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bokondji bo Yesu bodonga adi nda??</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11, 27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu adaka aleha bato ta bopango bo tepelo, ko atɔndɔkɔ Bwɛndi Bopele; bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balehi ba mobeko na bakumu ba ibonga, baduaka. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Lotɔndea ta kombe e nda? Akɔkɔ na wɛ meako mi? Opa kpatsi emina nda?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Mbi pongono, napalaka nohɔdjeni. Tɔndeanini: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Olomaka Yoane bobatisa bato nda? Edi Ndjakomba kaoko bato?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Balɛdjɛkɛ ibo na ibo: «Lokasɔmbedja: “Edi Ndjakomba omoloma abatise”, alohɔdjɔke: “Eda na nu pɛ bodimea Yoane nde?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Endolo lokabala: “Edi bato bamolomaka”, bato basusu balolake mabanga tine bolowa, tengasa bato banɛnɛ bapangoamaka boo Yoane adi mbaeli o Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Na bea basɔmbedjaka: «Iso lotadjebaka yona omoloma tine bobatisa.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />«Na bea, Yesu asɔmbedjaka, mbi pongono nitadjeba, nototɔndeakeni ndani opini kpatsi ebokɔ meako imi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i baoneli ba bobila</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ngɔngimina, Yesu abalaka na bato isɛ di: «Moto omɔti aonaka gbie e vino, aekinaka ta mɔmɔ ma basali ko akɛkɛ mɔndɔ tine masu manɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ehole e bobuka mbuma eimeaka, alomaka mosali omɔti adi basali ba gbie e vino tine bamolome i nde ibondo. Endolo basali ba gbie babomaka mosali omina ko bamoyanedjaka mɔmɔ ngasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Moswa gbie alomaka mosali okina, endolo basali ba gbie bamobomaka pongono, bamosingaka ko bamoyanedjaka mɔmɔ ngasa. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Alomaka mosali o basato pongono; basali ba gbie yena bamobenedjaka ko bamodumbaka sokolu. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Moswa gbie asabaleaka: “Nakɔe edɛdi boo? Nalomake mwana o mbi oepaeli; ehole ekina yo bamosumake!” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Endolo ehole emoenɛkɛ basali ba gbie, basabaleanaka: “Endjani mosangoli, lomowoe gbie edike e biso.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Na bea bamodumbaka sokolu e gbie ko bamowaka.<verse eid="LUK 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ahulaka yo mɛnɛ, aowedjake basali bamina ko apake gbie e nde adi basali bakina.» Ehole eokaka bato kɔpi imina, babalaka: «Ngasa midjɔ tungu ye mitakɔmɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Endolo Yesu abaendjaka ko abalaka: «Mobalo mu mo makomi matingodjaka ye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">“Ibanga idumbaka batongi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">imei ibanga i tina?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 118, 22.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Moto mosusu okwabi ta diko i ibanga imina ibukeanabi; ko ibanga ikakwa ta diko i moto, imominakakabi.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Puti e mokondji</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Balehi ba mobeko ko na bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba bohombaka enɔi e bopea Yesu ta ehole emina, tengasa badjebaka boo abalaka isɛ dia tina e bobo; endolo babangaka bato. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Baimeaka bolɔndɔ Yesu mɛnɛ. Na tina emina, bamolomeaka bato ibamolɔndɔkɔ elenge bato bapele. Bato bamina baboanaka bopikea Yesu elambo na mibalo mi nde, bɛngi badie enɔli e bomokaba ta kpatsi ko adi gupɛnɛlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Molehi, lokadjebe okabale, okalehe bopele, toendjake bobe bomoto, endolo okalake mobalo mo Ndjakomba na soti. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Na bea lotɔndea, mobeko mo biso malolomaka kaoko ngasa, boputa puti e kumu o ba Loma?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Endolo elenge Yesu adjebaka yo elambo e bobo abasɔmbedjaka: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Inedjanini ebende e pata. Epweya ko na kombe ekoma bo ta ebende emina, bo nda?» «Bo kumu Sedjale», <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Pani adi Sedjale lo Sedjale, pani adi Ndjakomba lo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Baimodiaka na mobunga na mibalo mi nde ta miso ma bato. Mosɔmbedja mo nde mobakamodjaka ko batakaka eka e bobala.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdjɔ tine bopusoa bo bago</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk 12, 18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ekenge e Basadokai baduaka adi Yesu. Ibo te badimake boo bopusoa ta tei e bago bodi. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Molehi, Mose alokomeaka mobeko mu: “Ekada moto adi na mwange nde, moto omina asɔi mwali ko agwi pɛ bokina bana; mwange nde asɔke mwali yona okina mwanango ko abotake na nde bana bɛngi asɔmbedji denga i mwange nde yona ogwa.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Enakobea edaka ta ibota imɔti i bana bami sambo. Oboso asɔkɔ mwali ko agwaka pɛ bobota. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />O babae, asɔkɔ mwali o mwanga nde ogwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />ngɔngɔ ekɔmɔkɔ pongono na o basato. Enakobea ekɔmɔ pongono na bu basusu sambo, bagwaka pɛ bobota. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Suka suka mwali omina agwaka pongono. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Ta isu i bopusoa i bago, mwali omina adabi o nda? Tengasa bo basusu sambo bamoasɔkɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Bamina bali ba ngondo ye bakasɔne; <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />endolo bamina bali bia babɔngedjama ta bopusoa bodi ta ngondo yena aduake, bato ba mina basɔnetebi. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Batagwabi naikina, badabi elenge babwɛndji. Badi bana ba Ndjakomba, tengasa Ndjakomba abasisodja ta tei e bago. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mose abalaka bohu boo bago basɔmbɔbi ta mohelo. Ta ikomi labalaka tine e ipumba ibwanaka bisanga, abeaka, Kumu “Ndjakomba o Abalayama, Ndjakomba o Isaka ko Ndjakomba o Djakobo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja Mba 3, 2,6.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ndjakomba, aditi o bato bago, endolo adi Ndjakomba o bato badi na bomɔ; tengasa bo basusu badi na mohelo tine nde.» <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Ekenge e balehi ba mobeko babalaka: «Obali bopele, Molehi.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Baimohɔdjɔkɔ naikina.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya na Dapiti</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12, 35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Baboani bobala Kilito adi mwana o Dapiti boo? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Tengasa Dapiti yo mɛnɛ abalaka, ta buku e ndjembo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Kumu Ndjakomba abalaka na Kumu o mbi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">Dua adae ta ebɔ e mbi e bami,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mbunoko aimedje baloni ba wɛ edaeli e wɛ e mako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 110, 1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dapiti, amobeaka “Kumu”: Ndenge nda Masiya aboani adae pongono mwana o Dapiti?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedji balehi ba mobeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Enakobea bato basusu badaka bamohokamedja, Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Dani na edinga na balehi ba mobeko ibakasasepedje bodala na mikoto miyai ko bakapale bodimaka ndese i ekumu ta polo i bhuda, bohɔɔkɔ bidie bi boso ta ba sinagoga ko bidie bi ekumu ta tɛkɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bakongɔne miongɔnɔ miyai tine bokosea bali ibagwa na bami tine bobakatoa leka lo bobo. Basambedjamabi na bopipo mɛnɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ikabo i mwali motakeli ogwa na momi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk 12, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu aendjaka mbuti na nde aenɛkɛ badieli baisaka bipeli ta sanga ikadae ta tepelo. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Aenɛkɛ pongono mwali omɔti ogwa na momi motakeli, apaka bibende bibae bi palanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Abalaka: «Notɔndeakani, edi soti: mwali yo ogwa na momi motakeli api bonɔ bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Tengasa, bato basusu bapaka ibondja ikɛkɛ mɛnɛ bokima bodiele bo bobo. Endolo yo, ta botaka bo nde, api losusu lodaki na nde tine ahelame na lu.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali tina e bobeha bo tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bato bakina badaka babala tine tepelo: Endja moda modi ndako ye na mabanga mapele ko na leka lobondjeaka bo Ndjakomba! Endolo Yesu asɔmbedjaka: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Masu maduake, pɛ ibanga ikina ta na mabanga imi maenɛkɛ no; idiketebi ibaki diko i ibanga ikina: masusu mabukeanabi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjokwa ko binɔngi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13, 3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Molehi, ehole ekɔmɔbi modjɔ momina nda? Embete einedjabi modjɔ momina mokaimeabi nda?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Sangatanani, pɛ bosakoseani. Tengasa bato banɛnɛ baduabi na kombe e mbi, ko babalakabi: “Edi mbi Masiya! Kaoko ehole emina eimei!” Endolo pɛ bobakimanani. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ehole eokabi no gala i bila ko na wusuwusu, pɛ bobangani. Tengasa midjɔ mimina miboani bokɔmɔ boso; endolo edaetebi mɛnɛ suka e ngondo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Na bea abalaka naikina: «Ekomi emɔti eanedjabi ekomi ekina, bokumu bomɔti boanedjabi bokumu bokina; <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kpɔtɔ i kumanabi ta bisika tungu na tungu, ndja ko na mihulɔhulɔ; midabi na bopipo; Midjɔ mibokamoa ko bimbete binɛnɛ bienɛmɛbi ta busa. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Endolo boso bo midjɔ mimina, bopeabini, ko bonyɔkɔlɔbini, bokababini bɛngi bosambedjebini ta ba sinagoga ko boisabini ta bɔlɔkɔ; bosambedjabini boso bo bakondji ko bo ba Gupɛnɛlɛ tina e mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Edabi tine bino enɔeli eboda batemo ta tina e mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Isakani ta malɛno ma bino boo, oditini na tina ebosatungeani na midjɔ miboani na nu bobala ta ehole akɛke no ta bosamba. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Tengasa mbi mɛnɛ nopabini mibalo ko djebeli iye edi pɛ nongo omɔti ta tei e baloni ba bino aboani bolongeani. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Edae basange i bino, banange i bino, bange i bino, denga i bino ko badjebani ba bino; baokababini; bakɔbi boo baleneabi banɛnɛ ta tei e bino bitumbu bi bogwa, tine mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bato basusu baolonabini tina e mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Endolo pɛ nongo moswe momɔti ta molo mo bino mobungetebi. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Na tina emina: bhingi e bino, eheledjabi mihelo mi bino.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi bobeha bo Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24, 15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk 13, 14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Ehole enɛbi no Yelusalɛmɛ ehikami na basoda, odjebabini, ta ehole emina yena, bobeha bo yu boimei mbuti. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Na bea, ibadabi ta Yudea batiabi ta makoli; ibadabi ta tei e Yelusalɛmɛ batiabi bohali, ibadabi ta gbie bahuletebi ta ibonga. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Tengasa edabi masu ma esambi, tine bokokedja misusu mikomama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ose 9, 7.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Ndjokwa edabi ta masu mamina, tina e bali ba memi ko na bia banungeakabi! Tengasa edabi na saya epipo ta ngondo ko kɛlɛ e Ndjakomba enɛmɛbi tina e bato bamina. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Baowamabi na ilɔndɔ, babapeabi elenge babuli ta bikomi bi bakɛndɛli, ko ngondo ibapangano badalakakabi Yelusalɛmɛ mbunoko ehole ebapa bo ekakokabi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodua bo mwana o Moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13, 24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Edabi na bimbete ta modakabusa, ta songe ko ta ndjɔtɔ. Ta ngondo, ta tina e ngilimo bato ba ibonga dabi na milema diko, na bokɛsɛdji tine ngilimo i dua djinɛnɛ ko na mula. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Banɛnɛ bagwabi na bɔɔ na bolɛdjɛ midjɔ misusu mikɔmɔbi ta ngondo. Tengasa ngulu i busa djikwabi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Na bea baenɛbi Mwana o Moto bodua ta itute, na ngulu ko na ekumu enɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 7, 13</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ehole ebangabi midjɔ mimina bokɔmɔ, angɔni ko emeani melo, tengasa botingoama bo bino bobatami.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eleho epami tine mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na bu isɛ di: «Endjani mole mo pigi ko mele mikina: <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ehole enino kasa ibangi botɔ, wadjebakeni bodidi bopele bobatami. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Oko moda momina tina e bino, ehole enino midjɔ mimina boimea, djebani Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bobatami. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Nabali na nu, edi soti: Ehole ye enɔebitebi mbunoko midjɔ misusu mienɛme. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Busa na kpɔtɔ lonɔbi, endolo mibalo mi mbi minɔetebi.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epingedji e boda mosu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />«Sangatanani! Pɛ bobedjani milema mi bino milume na posa i boyaka, bolangoa, na bokɛsɛdji bo mohelo; pɛ bea busa bo esambi botaneabini gbundumo, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />elenge elambo. Tengasa ataedjake bato basusu badi ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Pɛ bowɛni, ongɔnɔkɔni bihole bisusu! Ta ndjea emina wadiakeni ngulu e bolonga misusu mimeake ko waemakeni ta boso bo Mwana o Moto.» <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Ta ehole e moi, Yesu alehaka ta bopango bo tepelo; endolo mɔmɔkɔ, aimaka ta bopango bo tepelo akɛkɛ anɔdjɔ bulu ta ngomba e Olipa. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Ko bato basusu badaka badua bihuma bisusu tine bomohokamedja.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Bakondji ba Bayuda bada inginda tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ehole e tɛkɛ e miɛmbɛ mi pɛ levile, ebeamaka Pasika, ebatamaka; <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba na balehi ba mobeko bahombaka enɔeli ebowa Yesu, endolo babangaka bato.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi adihi mbuno e bokaba Yesu adi bakondji ba Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14, 10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Satana akweaka adi Yudasi, obeamaka Isikaliota. Yo adaka omɔti o batingami domi na babae. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yudasi akɛkɛ aokana na bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba na bakondji bakabane tepelo ta bohomba enoeli ebokaba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Basepaka mɛnɛ ko bamodikanaka bamopa palanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudasi adimaka ko aimeaka bohomba enɔeli epele tine bokaba Yesu, tine bato badae pɛ bodjeba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batingami babɔngedji mia ma pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14, 12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Aimeaka isu i tɛkɛ e miɛmbɛ mi pɛ bole, busa bowakabo bana ba bhata tine pasika; <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu alomaka Piɛlɛ ko Yoane. Abalaka na bu: «Kɛni alobɔngedjeni mia ma Pasika.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Apalaka wɛ lokaebɔngedja djɔ?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Abalaka na bu: «Ehole akweakeno ta ibonga, wasakanakeni na momi omɔti alwali mbola e madiba. Mokimanani mbunoko ta ndako akweake yo. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Balani na moswa ndako: “Molehi aohɔdjɔkɔ: Adi ekenge e ndako eboani na mbi boyaka mia ma Pasika na batingami djɔ?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Yo ainedjakeni ta egbili, ekenge e ndako enɛnɛ ebɔngedja bo na leka losusu loboani oho diko. Edi oho wabɔngedjakeni mia ma pasika.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bakɛkɛ, bataneaka misusu oko elenge abalaka Yesu na bu ko babɔngedja mia ma Pasika.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa e Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Aimeaka ehole, Yesu adaka ta mesa na bapɔsɔlu ba nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Abalaka na bu: «Nadaki na posa nayake na nu mia ma Pasika boso bo enɔngi! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Tengasa, nabali na nu, nayaketebi naikina mbunoko bodua bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Atombaka kɔbɔ, apaka Ndjakomba mɛlɛsi ko abalaka: «Tombani kɔbɔ ye ko ekabanani ta ndanda e bino; <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Tengasa, nabali na nu, donga edɛdi namwɛtebi naikina mana ma vino ye mbunoko bodua bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ngɔngɔ atombaka mwɛmbɛ apaka Ndjakomba mɛlɛsi, alenakaka ko abapaka. Abalaka na bu: «Iye edi mokuku mo mbi mokabami tina e bino. Kɔkɔni bea tine bolɛdjɛni.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Abapaka pongono kɔbɔ, ngɔngɔ i mia, abalaka: «Akɔkɔ oko moda momina mondumba mokɔ yo na kɔbɔ. Abalaka: Kɔbɔ ye edi bwela boyanie ta ndjea e makia ma mbi masopeake tina e bino. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Endolo endjani: mokabi o mbi adi ya, ayaka ta mesa engbanga emɔti na mbi! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Soti, Mwana o Moto agwake bokokana na mbuno e Ndjakomba; endolo ndjokwa na yona omokabi!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Bapɔsɔlu baimeaka bosahɔdjɔnɔ tine bodjeba moto ndani ta ndanda e bobo oboani bokɔ modjɔ mo mina.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onɔi na bonɛnɛ nda?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Bapɔsɔlu babomanaka kitɛ na ngulu tine bodjeba moto onɔi bina nde na bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Bakondji ba ngondo bakangɔndje bato ba bobo ko badi na kpatsi adiko i bobo; bakapale bababeake bato bapele. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Endolo etada bea tina e bino. Onɔi na bonɛnɛ ta ndanda e bino atombe polo esuka; ko yona apalaka adae mokondji adae elenge mosali. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Tengasa yona onɔi na bonɛnɛ nda? Yona odi ta mesa kaoko yona akɔmedjaka? Editi yona odi ta mesa? Na bea, mbi nadi ta ndanda e bino elenge yona akɔmedjaka! <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Ino odakani na mbi seko ta mameko. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ndenge emɔti sange mbi apani Bokumu, mbi pongono nopakani Bokumu: <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />wayakeni ko wamwakeni mesa emɔti na mbi ta Bokumu bo mbi, ko odabini ta ngbɛndɛ tine bosambedja mabota domi na mabae ma Isalɛlɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14, 22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />«Simo, Simo! Oka: Satana ahombaka enɔeli tine aopupeni elenge akapupe bo mbuma i bule. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Endolo mbi nongɔni tine wɛ, tine boo edimeli e wɛ esakwa. Ko ehole asɔmbeakeni wɛ, pingedja bange i wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Kumu, nadi mbuti nakɛ na wɛ ta bɔlɔkɔ ko nagwɛ na wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Nabali na wɛ, Piɛlɛ, boso bo kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔ busa bu wainganeakeni mbala isato boo otadjebakani.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Palanga, sɛki ko na mopamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na bu: «Ehole eolomakani mbi elomu pɛ palanga, pɛ sɛki, pɛ sapato; otakakani eka?» «Bamosɔmbedjaka, ngasa loitakaka eka.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Na bea abalaka na bu: «Endolo edɛdi, yona odi na palanga aetombe, moda momɔti na yona odi na sɛki; ko yona odi pɛ mopamba atɛke esendja e nde bɛngi asombe ekina. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Tengasa, nabali na nu, etungi ekokedjame ta mohelo mo mbi: “Adaka ta ndanda e motango mo baoweli ba bato babe” Na bea, na balaka na nu etungi misusu mikokedjakani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 53, 12.</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Batingami babalaka: «Kumu, endja mipamba mibae imi.» Yesu asɔmbedjaka «Mikoki oko bea!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongɔni ta ngomba e Olipa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14, 32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu aimaka ko akɛkɛ, elenge elamaka yo, ta ngomba e Olipa. Batingami ba nde bamokimanaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ehole eimeaka yo ta polo emina, abalaka na bu: «Ongɔnɔni, osakwani ta bomekama.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Na bea asasuaka na bu mo tɔtɔkɔ, akwaka magbundɔ ko aongɔnɔkɔ <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />na mibalo imi: «Sange mbi, okapala, dongedjani kɔbɔ ye e saya. Mokano mo mbi modae pɛ bokokedjama endolo mo wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Na bea obwɛndji amoimaneaka donga ta busa amopingedjaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Adaka na saya enɛnɛ ta molema, aongɔnɔkɔ na bhingi mɛnɛ. Ipetola i nde imeaka elenge matanga ma makia makwaka ta kpɔtɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekenge ye e mokanda editi ta mikanda minɛnɛ mi boso</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ngɔngɔ i bongɔnɔ, angɔkɔ, ahulaka adi batingami ko abataneaka bawɛli, baembɛi na ndjokwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Abalaka na bu: «Owɛlini tina nda? Angɔni ko ongɔnɔni, osakakwani ta bomekama.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoa 18, 3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ehole edaka yo abala na emumu e bato eimeaka ko Yudasi, omɔti o batingami domi na babae, yo moto obadaledjaka. Abatamaka mbuti na Yesu bɛngi amobhimbe. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na nde: «Yudasi, edi na bobhimbani okabi Mwana o Moto?» <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ehole enɛkɛ batingami badalaka na Yesu modjɔ momina, bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, loboani loane na mipamba?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ko omɔti o bobo alenaka mosali o nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba itoi i ebɔ e bami. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Endolo Yesu abalaka: «Kinani, moboani oko bea!» Apeaka itoi i moto omina ko ahelaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, na bakondji bakabane tepelo na bakondji ba ibonga, ibaduaka abomopea: «Odoini na mipamba na mihukuku, elenge nadi moweli o moto? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Masu masusu, nadaka na nu ta tepelo ko oihombani bopeanini. Endolo ehole ye edi e bino ko na ngulu e modidi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:57-75">Mat 26, 57-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk 14, 53-54</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-27">Yoa 18, 12-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ibea bapeaka Yesu, bakɛkɛ na nde ngbandengba ta ndako e mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba. Piɛlɛ abakimanaka mo bohali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bayodjaka mosa ta ndalengando e bopango bomina ko Piɛlɛ adaka ndanda e bato ibadaka bahiki. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mosali mwali omɔti, amoenɛkɛ mbuti na mosa; amotingeaka miso ko abalaka: «Moto yo pongono adaki na nde.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Endolo Pielɛ ainganaka ko abalaka: «Natamodjebaka.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Mo ehole mokɛkɛ ngɔngɔ, moto okina amoenɛkɛ abalaka: «Wɛ pongono, odi omɔti o bobo!» Endolo Piɛlɛ asɔmbedjaka: «Ngasa, te mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ngɔngɔ i ehole emɔti, moto okina pongono apingedjaka bobala na ngulu: «Edi soti, moto iyo adalaki na nde, tengasa adi Mogalilea.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Endolo Piɛlɛ asɔmbedjaka: «Natadjebaka meako mia mabalaka wɛ.» Oko ta ehole edaka yo abala, kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Kumu ahombanaka ko akokoledjaka Piɛlɛ. Na bea Piɛlɛ alɛnɛkɛ mibalo mibalaka Kumu na nde: «Boso bo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle busa bu, wainganeakeni mbala isato.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Piɛlɛ aimi sokolu ayeaka na ndjokwa mɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basingi Yesu ko bamokɛsɛkɛkɛ mabalake</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26, 67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk 14, 65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bato ibabaneaka Yesu, bamotaaka ko bamobomaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bamodipaka boso ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Obomi nda? Elɛ bonganga!» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Ko bamosingaka na kɔpi djinɛnɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta boso bo bakumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26, 59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14, 55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoa 18, 19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ehole eya busa, bakumu ba Bayuda, na bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko balehi ba mobeko babolamaka. Baduaka na Yesu ta boso bo ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Lotɔndea, wɛ odi Kilito? » Abasɔmbedjaka: «Nakotɔndeani, otadimeakenini, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ko nakohɔdjɔni ihɔdjɔ, otasɔmbedjakenini. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Endolo donga edɛdi Mwana o Moto adabi ta ebɔ e bami e Ndjakomba onɔi na sueya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 118, 1.</char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bato basusu bagamaka: «Wɛ mɛnɛ odi Mwana o Ndjakomba?» Abasɔmbedjaka: «Obalini.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Na bea babalaka: «Loditi naikina na posa e batemo! Tengasa looki so bɛnɛ na monɔkɔ mo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta boso bo Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ibolea i bato basusu bangɔkɔ ko bakɛkɛ na Yesu ta boso bo Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Oho, bamopundaka na mibalo imi: «Lotanei moto iyo apa bato ba ibonga i biso molo mobe: asiaka bato badae pɛ boputa puti e mokondji Sedjale ko abali yo mɛnɛ boo adi Kilito, epalaka e bale boo Kumu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Odi mokondji o Bayuda?» Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ obali.» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato abalaka na bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na emumu e bato: «Naeniti modjɔ mobe moboani na mbi bopa moto iyo etumbo.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Endolo bapingedja na bopipo mɛnɛ: «Akapɛ bato ba biso molo mobe na bileho bi nde. Abanga ta Galilea, ko anɔkɔ ta Yudea esusu, edɛdi, aimei iya.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta boso bo Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ehole eoka Pilato mibalo mia, ahɔdjɔkɔ: «Moto yo adi moto o Galilea?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ehole eoka Pilato boo Yesu adongaka ta ibonga idaka Elode Gupɛnɛlɛ; amolomaka adi Elode, yona odaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ masu mamina. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Elode asepaka mɛnɛ ta boenɛ Yesu. Tengasa, aokaka babala tine nde ko asepaka basakane donga ehele. Adaka na edinga boo Yesu akɔke embete e ngindola. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Amohɔdjɔkɔ mahɔdjɔ manɛnɛ, endolo Yesu aimosɔmbedjaka. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bakondji ba banganga ko na balehi ba mobeko badaka ena ko bamopundaka na midjɔ mibe. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Elode na basoda ba nde baimeaka bomota ko bomonyɔkɔlɔ. Bamolwadjaka esendja epele ko bamosɔmbedjaka adi Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Donga ehele Elode na Pilato baiyokanaka; endolo ta busa bua, baimeaka bopalana.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badimi boo Yesu agwɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15, 6-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato atitanedjaka bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, bakondji ba ibonga ko na bato. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Abalaka na bu: «Odɔini na moto iyo bobala bo apaka bato ba bino molo mobe. Na bea, na mosambedji ta boso bo bino ko na modihiti nongo na mobunga ko na modjɔ mobe mo mopundi na nu. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Elode pongono aimodiaka nongo na mobunga, na tina emina amosɔmbedjaka adi so. Moto iyo akɔiti nongo bobe bomɔti boboani na nde bodia etumbo ebogwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Namokɛsɛkɛke oto mbalake, ngɔngɔ na mokinake.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Engi tɛkɛ e Pasika, Pilato adaka aimedja mobɔlɔkɔ omɔti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekenge ye editi ta mikanda minɛnɛ mi boso</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Endolo bo basusu bagamaka engbanga: «Owa moto omina! Lotingoaso Balabase!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balaba apeamaka ta bɔlɔkɔ tine boo aisaka wusuwusu ta ibonga inɛnɛ ko aowaka moto. Na tina emina bamoisaka ta bɔlɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato apalaka botingoa Yesu, asɔmbɔkɔ naikina bobahɔdjɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Endolo bato bagamaka: «Abakame ta ekulusu abakame ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato abahɔdjɔkɔ mbala e basato: «Bobe bokɔi yo nda? Na modihiti nongo na mobunga momɔti bɛngi agwɛ. Namokɛsɛdjake mbalake ngɔngɔ na motingoake.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Endolo bapingedjaka naikina: «Mobaka ta Ekulusu.» Ko migamo mi bobo midimamaka: <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilato adimaka bakokedje posa e bobo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Atingoaka moto ohɔdjɔkɔ bo ko yona oisaka bo ta bɔlɔkɔ tine mobulu ko aowaka moto, Pilato abapaka Yesu bɛngi bakokedje posa e bobo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babaki Yesu ta Ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ehole epeaka bo Yesu ngbandengba, basakanaka na Simo, moto o Kulɛnɛ, yona odaka ahule ta gbie. Basoda bamopeaka ko bamotombedjaka ekulusu bɛngi asonge na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Emumu e bato ekimanaka Yesu, bali pongono badaka bayea ko bosatungeaka tina e nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu ahombanaka ko abaendjaka, abalaka: «Ba maa ba Yelusalɛmɛ, pɛ boyeani tina e mbi! Endolo yeani tina e bino ko bana ba bino! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Tengasa masu maduake babalabi: “Sepi adi batete ko ibadi pɛ bonungea!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Babalakabi na makoli: “Kwani diko i biso!” Ko na makoli: “Lokundani!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Tengasa bakakɔ midjɔ mi na mole motɔtu bea, ekɔbi bo na mole mokakanake nde?» <verse eid="LUK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Bakɛkɛ na baoweli ba bato babea ngbandengba, bɛngi bagwɛ na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Aimeaka bo ta polo ekabe bo «Egɔgɔlɔ e molo», basoda babakaka Yesu ta ekulusu, engbanga na batɔmbi babae, omɔti ta e bɔ e bami okina ta e bɔ e bali. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Ibea Yesu abalaka: «Sange mbi, bayɛ, tengasa batadjebaka eka akɔkɔ bo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekenge ye editi ta mikanda minɛnɛ mi boso.</char></note>Bakabanaka bisendja bi nde na boboma djonga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 22, 19.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Bato baemaka ena ko baendjaka. Bakondji ba Bayuda bamotaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 228, 9.</char></note> eni babala: «Aheledjaka bakina bato; atako saheledja yo mɛnɛ, akada adi Kilito, yona ohɔ Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Basoda pongono badaka bomosɛkɛ; babatamaka ko bamopaka mana ma ngayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 69, 22.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Babalaka: «Okada Bakondji ba Bayuda, saheledja wɛ mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ta diko i molo mo nde bakomaka: «Moto iyo adi Bakondji ba Bayuda.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Omɔti obaoweli ba bato obakaka bo ta ekulusu amosingaka: «Wɛ oditi Kilito? Saheledja ko heledjaso pongono!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Endolo okina agameaka mina nde. Amosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ otabanga Ndjakomba, wɛ odihi etumbo moda momɔti na nde? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Tine biso, etumbo edi bodjo, tengasa lodihi etumbo eboani na misala mi biso; endolo yo akɔiti bobe.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ko abalaka: «Yesu, omalɛdjɛni ehole eduabi wɛ boda Kumu.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Nabali na wɛ, edi soti: oko busa bu wadake na mbi ta paladiso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paladiso etingodji polo ye e bato bahekodja milema ta pamba e Ndjakomba ko badabi na nde, ko basepabi na nde polo emɔti ngɔngɔ.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15, 33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Edaka mbuti na midi: modidi mokɔmɔkɔ ta ngondo esusu mbuti na bihole bisato ngɔngɔ i midi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Lido edaka esɛpi ta tepelo ealeaka bipasa bibae. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu agamaka na moholi mopipo: «Sange mbi, nasɔmbedji mwembo mo mbi ta mɔmɔ ma wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 31, 6.</char></note>.» Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, Yesu agwaka. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Kapitɛne o basoda mokama o Loma aenɛkɛ yo modjɔ momina; akumedjaka Ndjakomba ko abalaka: «Soti mɛnɛ moto iyo adaki bodjo!» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Emumu e bato baduaka aendja modjɔ momina, baenɛkɛ eka ekɔmɔkɔ. Na bea bayanaka bapeli mɔmɔ ta melo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta polo ekomi so boo asapeaka ta molo edi adaka aboma bupa. Enakobea, tina e bayuda embete e boboma bupa edi embete e ndjokwa. Ta tina e biso edi embete e molumba</char></note> na ndjokwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Badjebani ba Yesu, na bali ibamopakeaka donga ta Galilea, ba semeaka bohali ko baendjaka eka edaka anɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapusei Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Edaka na moto omɔti kombe e nde Esepu. Adaka moto o ibonga i Alimatayo. Moto omina adaka mopele ko bodjo, ko ambaka bodua bo Bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Adaka omɔti o ibolea i basuku, endolo aidimaka eka ekɔkɔ basuku bakina na edima bo bokɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Akɛkɛ adi Pilato amɔhɔdjɔ mokuku mo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Atitedjaka mokuku momina ta ekulusu, amohuaka na mbendja e motuya monɛnɛ ko amoisaka ta ikila itɔkɔ bo ta ibanga, ta polo eda bo pɛ bopusea moto boso. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Edaka mɔmɔkɔ mo isu i mosalingo mo busa bo sabata. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bali badalaka engbanga na Yesu donga Galilea, baduaka engbanga na Esepu; baendjaka ikila ko baenɛkɛ moda mosambeaka bo mokuku mo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ngɔngɔ bayanaka ta ibonga inɛnɛ ko basalingoaka na minɛ na misoloa miso elitindi tine bosopea mokuku. Isu i sabata, bahemaka, tine bosuma mobeko.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Bopusoa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28, 1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ehuma e busa bo eyenga, bali bakɛkɛ ta ikila, na misoloa miso e itindi imibɔngedjaka bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 23, 56</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Baenɛkɛ ibanga idipaka bo ta ikila balihilingodjaka; <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />bakweaka, endolo baitaneaka mokuku mo Kumu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Elenge ayekama bo: bami babae balwaka bisendja bidaka bangɛsɛ babimaneaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Balumaka na bɔɔ mɛnɛ ko basuneaka maso ma bobo ta kpɔtɔ bami bamina babalaka na bu: «Tina ndani wahombakani ta ndanda e bago moto o bomɔ? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Aditi ya, asapusoi. Lɛdjɛni mibalo miobaleakani yo ehole edaka yo oho ta Galilea: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />“Etungi Mwana o Moto akabame adi bato babe, abakame ta Ekulusu ko apusoe ta tei e bago ta isu i basato.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Balɛdjɛkɛ mibalo mi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Badongaka ta ikila ko bakɛkɛ atɔndɔ meako mi mina adi batingami domi na omɔti ko bato bakina. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Edaka Malia e Magadala, Yoana ko na Malia, nange e Djake. Bali bakina badaka na bu babalaka oko bea meako mimina adi bapɔsɔlu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Endolo bapɔsɔlu balɛdjɛkɛ meako mibalaka bali bamina midongaka ta malɛno ma bobo bɛnɛ ko baimidimaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Oko ta ehole emina Piɛlɛ angɔkɔ akɛ ebango ta ikila; asunamaka ko aenɛkɛ oto bipasa bi bisendja. Ngɔngɔ ayanaka oho adakabo, eni akamoe meako imi minɔmɔkɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ta ndjea e Emausu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk 16, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Oko ta isu imina, batingami babae badaka bakɛ ta ibonga emɔti kombe Emausu. Bohali bo Emausu na Yelusalɛmɛ bodaka ba kilomɛtɛlɛ mbuti na domi na bibae. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Badaka basabaleane ta tina e meako misusu imi nɔmɔkɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ehole edaka bo basabaleana ko basabomeana kite, Yesu yo mɛnɛ abatamaka ko adalaka na bu engbanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bamoenɛkɛ; endolo baimosipoaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Eka asabaleanakano wadaleni nde?» Baemaka, na ndjokwa esusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Omɔti o bobo, kombe Keopasi, abalaka na nde: «Bato basusu ba Yelusalɛmɛ badjebi meako manɔkɔ masu mi oko wɛ moto adaka pɛ bomidjeba?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Abahɔdjɔkɔ: «modjɔ nda??» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Imu mokɔmi na Yesu o Nasaleta! Adaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba o ngulu; aminedjaka na misala ko na mibalo mi nde ta boso bo Ndjakomba ko ta boso bo bato basusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na basuku ba ibonga bamokaba bɛngi bamopɛ etumbo e bogwa ko bamobake ta ekulusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Lodaka na ndingo edi yo moto obwanaka bosikoa Isalɛlɛ. Endolo ta misusu mia, edi busa bu isu i basato donga akɔmi modjɔ mo mina. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Bakina bali ba engbanga e biso balokamodji. Bakɛkɛ nahindihindi ta ikila <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />endolo baitaneaka mokuku mo nde. Bahulaka ko balotɔndeaka boo babwɛndji basaenɛmedjaki na bu ko babatɔndeaki boo adi na bomɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bakina binasu bakɛkɛ ta ikila ko bataneaka misusu oko moda ebatɔndeaka bali, endolo yo, baimoenɛkɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Bato bataka ebowɛi! Tina ndani milema mi bino te midime meako misusu mikotɔndeni Ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Eboanakiti boo Kilito anɔnge boso bo bokwea ta e kumu e nde?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ngɔngɔ abatingodjaka mibalo mikomama ta makomi, bobanga ta buku i Mose ko na buku isusu i ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ehole ebatamaka bo na ibonga yena ekɛkɛ bo, Yesu akɔkɔ elenge bokimana ndjea ekɛkɛ yo. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Endolo bamosiaka babalaka: «Daa na su; busa boimei mɔkɔmɔkɔ ko bulu boimei.» Akweaka ko adaka na bu. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ehole edaka yo na bu ta mesa, atombaka mwɛmbɛ ko apaka Ndjakomba mɛlɛsi; abukakaka mwɛmbɛ ko abapaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Na bea, miso ma bobo madipoamaka ko bamosipoa; endolo alɛmoaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Basabaleanaka: «Milema mi biso midaka na sepi ehole ebalaka yo na su ta ndjea ko elotingodjaka yo makomi?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Na mbala emɔti basangɔdjɔkɔ ko basɔmbɔkɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. Bataneaka batingami domi na omɔti bato bakina badaka polo emɔti, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />babalaka na bu: «Soti Kumu apusoi! Nasenɛmedji na Simo!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ibo pongono babatɔndeaka meako iminɔkɔ na bu na ndjea ko moda momosipoaka bo ehole ebukaka yo mwɛmbɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asenɛmedji na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoa 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bik 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Yana adakabo babala, Yesu asenɛmedjaka ta ndanda e bobo ko abalaka na bu: «Bogo bodae na nu!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Balumaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ, tengasa balɛdjɛkɛ baeni edjo. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na bu: «Oyegebanini tina nda? Tina e kitɛ ta milema mi bino nda? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Endjani mɔmɔ na mako ma mbi: edi oko mbi! Bɛndjɛnini ko endjanini, tengasa edjo editi na muni na mokuwa, elenge enɛkɛno adi mbi.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ehole ebalaka yo kɔpi imina abainedjaka mɔmɔ na mako ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Badaka na sepi enɛnɛ iyena ekɔkɔ bo badae pɛ ko bodima ko balumaka na bakamoa, abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Odini na eka oboyaka?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bamopaka ekenge o moswi ekalangake. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Aetombaka ko aeyaka ta boso bo bobo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na bu: «Ehole edaka mbi na nu, endjani meako miotɔndeakani mbi: imikomama ta tina e mbi ta mobeko mo Mose, ta buku i Ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ko ta ndjembo, misusu mibwani mikokedjame.» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Na bea abadipoaka bowɛi bɛngi basipoe makomi, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />ko abalaka na bu: «Endjani mikomama: Kilito atungi boka saya, ngɔngɔ apusoe ta tei e bago isu i basato,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 53; Ose 6, 2.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />ko etungi balehe na kombe e nde ta mabota masusu, bobanga ta Yelusalɛmɛ; bo babwani bahombedje milema ko na bodiha boyɛmɛ bo mabe. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Odini batemo ba meako mimina. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ko nalomake mbi mɛnɛ adi no yena eodikanani Sesa. Na bea no, dikani ta ibonga enɛnɛ mbunoko olumeni na ngulu adongake odiko.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aiwei ta busa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk 16, 19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bik 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abaimedjaka sokolu e ibonga enɛnɛ, mbuti na Betania, ko oho, angɔdjɔkɔ mɔmɔ abadjongoaka. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ehole adakayo ebadjongoa, agbɔtɔkɔ na bu ko aiwea ta busa. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Endolo bo, bamokumedjaka ko basɔmbɔkɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ, na mosepi monɛnɛ mɛnɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Badaka bihole bisusu ta tepelo bakumedjaka Ndjakomba.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>